SUMMARY:Queer Space and Trans Life: Eden Kinkaid's Disorienting
  Phenomenology - by Another Story Bookshop
LOCATION:Another Story Bookshop
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/queer-space-and-trans-life-eden-kinkaids-diso
 rienting-phenomenology-tickets-1998987160408\n\nHosted by Another Story
  Bookshop (https://anotherstory.ca/home)\n\nJoin this event for the launch
  of Eden Kinkaid's Disorienting Phenomenology! In conversation with Talia
  Mae Bettcher\, hosted by Schem Bader. Disorienting Phenomenology takes as
  its point of departure the trans mundane: entering a public restroom\,
  moving through airport security\, navigating professional spaces. 
END:VEVENT
