DESCRIPTION:The RWGPS route was updated on Thursday\, Oct 1\, 2026 due to 
 Trail closure at Airport Rd in Caledon East. Changed from Friday to Saturd
 ay\, Oct 3\, 2026 The Caledon Trailway Path is a treasure to ride - no car
 s\, mostly shaded\, packed surface easy to ride on. On this ride\, we'll p
 ark in Inglewood\, go south toward Terra Cotta to the trailhead with the M
 ile-0 marker\, then retrace to Inglewood and continue north to Palgrave fo
 r lunch at the Caledon Hills Brewing Company. After lunch we return to Ing
 lewood. This route features a mixture of stretches on the Trailway combine
 d with stretches on intersecting roads for variety. Mile-0 marker on the C
 aledon Trailway Path. Oct 3\, 2023 Caledon Hills Brewing...
