 tinue and complete\nbody oil-making\nIntroduction to\nfelt-making\nSeptemb
 er 26 | 10:00 AM–12:00 PM\nContinue working with\nfelt\nBegin the\nbeadi
 ng workshop\nSeptember 28 | 6:00–8:00 PM\nContinue\nfelting\nContinue th
 e\nbeading workshop\nOctober 3 | 10:00 AM–12:00 PM\nWork on\nfelting and
  beading projects\nOctober 7 | 6:00–8:00 PM\nFeast\nClosing Circle\nCele
 bration and completion of the program
