SUMMARY:The Allure of Street Photography
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261003T113000
UID:6a833bab386764026a17437a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Professional photographer\,\nNeill Sturgess\n\, leads an im
 mersive workshop exploring the captivating world of street photography. Th
 is program invites participants to delve into the essence of urban life\, 
 capturing its spontaneous moments and vibrant energy through the lens of a
 ny camera. Throughout the workshop\, participants will embark on a journey
  to understand the allure and techniques of street photography.\nParticipa
 nts will be able to participate with any of the following equipment:\nDigi
 tal camera\nFilm camera\nPhone camera\nThis program will be held in the\nA
 ctivity Room\,\nlocated on the first floor next to the coffee shop.\n[Phot
 o copyright Neill Sturgess Photography]
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Activity Room (first floor)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a833bab386764026a17437a
