DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an exciting day in the trees! Join us for a fun 
 outdoor adventure filled with aerial courses\, obstacles\, and challenges 
 as we make our way through the treetops. It’s a great opportunity to try
  something new\, challenge yourself\, and spend a fun day outdoors with fr
 iends.\nPlease keep in mind that this activity takes place high above the 
 ground.\nParticipant Requirements\nFor everyone’s safety\, participants 
 must meet the following requirements:\n\nMinimum height: 55 inches\nMaxim
 um weight: 250 lbs\nParticipants should be comfortable with heights and b
 eing active throughout the course.\n\nSchedule\n\n9:30 AM: Depart from Ta
 it McKenzie Centre (please arrive 15 minutes early)\n10:30 AM: Arrive and
  begin the Treetop Trekking course\n10:30 AM – 1:30 PM: Treetop Trekkin
 g adventure\n1:30 PM: Lunch/snack break\n2:00 PM: Depart for Tait McKenz
 ie Centre\nApproximately 3:00–4:00 PM: Return to Tait McKenzie Centre\n
 \nCome ready for a fun and adventurous day with friends! Wear comfortable 
 athletic clothing and closed-toe shoes\, and bring water\, snacks\, and a 
 lunch. Most importantly\, come ready to try something new and enjoy the da
 y outdoors!\nRegistration is required: https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Pro
 gram/GetProgramDetails?courseId=f559d020-b9d7-487f-92a5-89a0d97a3f17\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260911
LOCATION:Tait McKenzie Center @ 1 Thompson Rd\, North York
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/treetop-trekking-event/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
