SUMMARY:Mambo City & LLB Monthly Sat
DESCRIPTION:Marlborough School\, Draycott Avenue\, Chelsea\, London SW3 3AP \nJoin us each month in the heart of Chelsea for unforgettable Salsa and Bachata nights. Whether you’re just starting out or already an experienced dancer\, our events offer something for everyone\, great music\, expert instruction\, and a vibrant community atmosphere. \nEvent Overview\n1st Saturday of Each Month – Salsa & Bachata Party\nIn collaboration with London Loves Bachata (LLB) \nTwo Dedicated Rooms: Salsa & Bachata \nDoors Open: 8:00 PM \nClasses Start: 8:15 PM (3 Levels in both rooms) \nSocial Dancing Until: 1:00 AM
