BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Toronto Bruce Trail Club": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-bruce-trail-club/events/316303973/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_toronto_bruce_trail_club
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Bruce Trail Club
UID:event_316303973@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050450Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261004T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261004T160000
SUMMARY:Bus Hike: Limehouse (Bruce Trail Day)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bruce Trail Club\noin us to celebrate Bruce Trail Day 
 on the trail around Limehouse. For the first 5 km we will hike south from 
 the Sixth Line to Limehouse. The route incorporates the portion of trail r
 emoved from the Fifth Line thanks to those who support the Bruce Trail. We
 'll also pass the seed orchard where native species are grown for the seed
 s to be replanted to re-naturalize other parts of the trail. Those who wan
 t a shorter hike may drop out at Limehouse where information and refreshme
 nts will be available at the Memorial Hall. The second part of the hike wi
 ll be a loop through the Limehouse Conservation area featuring the limesto
 ne kilns\, stone arched bridge\, and a climb through the "hole in the wall
 ". Expect some slightly rocky terrain underfoot and a few moderate hills. 
 Hiking boots or good shoes designed for walking are a must. Those completi
 ng the full 9 km will also have a chance to drop in at the Memorial Hall t
 o learn more about the Bruce Trail and refreshments.\n\nYou must register 
 and prepay the bus fare on the Bruce Trail Conservancy Website (registrati
 on opens Sat Sep 20 8:00 PM (Bus Fares $25 Members/$32 Non-Members (Childr
 en under 12 $10/$14). Bus fares are non-refundable and the hike goes rain 
 or shine.\n\nRegistration Link:\n[https://hikes.brucetrail.org/event/bus-h
 ike-bruce-trail-day-limehouse/2026-10-04/](https://hikes.brucetrail.org/ev
 ent/bus-hike-bruce-trail-day-limehouse/2026-10-04/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-bruce-trail-club/events/31630
 3973/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260827T222743Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260827T222743Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Bicycling Network": "https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6832882"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_bicycling_network
SUMMARY:Sunday Tourist: Finch - Aurora (80 and 102 km)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261004T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261004T113000
UID:0c82aade11d72801b85a698498c1df2e@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:DESCRIPTION A ride through suburban side streets and country r
 oads skirting the Holland Marsh\, then heading south through Newmarket fol
 lowed by a lunch stop at Tim Hortons in Aurora. Meet at Finch Subway Stati
 on\, "Finch" west parking lot on the north side of Hendon Ave\, just west 
 of Yonge St. N.B. If you are travelling north on Yonge St\, keep going pas
 t Finch Ave and turn left onto Hendon Ave. The parking lot is on the right
  near 18 Hendon Ave\, North York . Not a member\, but you want to try this
  out? Sign up for our 30-Day-Trial membership and you can try out multiple
  TBN rides. See https://tbn.ca/join for details.
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/widget/event-6832882
