DESCRIPTION:Address:\nMOLA CAFE/MARKET\nCome to the back of the cafe!\nTor
 onto\, ON\nCanada\n\nWe're doing the most respectful thing we can think of
  to honour Dolly Parton: hot glueing rhinestones onto book covers until ou
 r hands cramp\nBring a book (your favourite\, a thrift find\, or something
  you never plan to read again) and we'll have the gun and bedazzler statio
 n ready.\nWe're talking full glam covers like sequins\, gems\, glitter\, n
 o such thing as too much. Dolly didn't build an empire on subtlety and nei
 ther will your book club copy of a novel you technically finished.\nOne co
 ffee\, matcha or tea drink from Mola Cafe and supplies to bedazzle your bo
 ok is included.\n—\nNew members…\n\nHosted by Wine About Books
