BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Experiencetoronto": "https://www.meetup.com/experiencetoronto/events/316406103/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_experiencetoronto
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Experience Toronto
UID:event_316406103@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050441Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261004T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261004T200000
SUMMARY:Anniversary Dinner at new Riley's Toronto Restaurant (St Andrew St
 ation)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Sunday\, October 4th\, join us for Ou
 r 7th Anniversary Dinner at Riley's Toronto.** Originally from Vancouver\,
  where it earned a Michelin recommendation\, [Riley’s Fish & Steak](http
 s://www.toronto.com/things-to-do/food-and-drink/rileys-toronto-job-fair/ar
 ticle_70356d1e-d920-5ce1-a5ef-6da107190973.html) launched in Toronto almos
 t 6 months ago. The seafood and chophouse will bring together “premium C
 anadian ingredients\, cinematic tableside presentations\, and a live music
  program — redefining what a downtown dining destination can be. The ope
 ning marks Glowbal Restaurant Group’s second Toronto restaurant\, follow
 ing Black + Blue.\n\n**COST**\nOrganizer Meetup fee: $5\n\nFor tables of 6
 +\, there will be an automatic gratuity and one bill.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\
 n* RSVP Yes. Everyone goes on the waitlist until they have reserved their 
 seat\, with an etransfer of $25 (includes $5 meetup fee). Attendees will r
 eceive back $20 the day after the event.\n* Once you are on the waitlist\,
  I will message you the email address for the etransfer.\n* Once the trans
 fer is complete\, I will move you to attending. There are no refunds for a
 ny reason.\n* A reminder will be sent the night before with my cell and al
 l meetup details. Make sure you set up your communication settings to rece
 ive.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior. Cancellations will result in a No Show a
 nd impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 5:30pm insi
 de the front doors of Riley's at 155 Wellington St. W.** Please wait for m
 e to arrive\, and do not sit on your own prior\, so we can get the table r
 equested.\n\nLength: 2.5 hours\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments in t
 he event after.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/experiencetoronto/events/316406103/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260903T185428Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260903T185428Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
