 g\, where live music\, scent\, light\, and space come together to create a
  place for rest and presence.\nSettle in\, get comfortable\, and experienc
 e two hours of live ambient sound within a softly transformed Ratelier.\nS
 cent. Live ambient music. Space to rest.\nYour ticket includes:\n2-hour en
 try to the experience\nLive ambient performance by Alex Lustig\nImmersive 
 scent…\n\nHosted by Ratelier Studio
