BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"YOHOMO": "https://www.yohomo.ca/event/friends-of-roxy---a-queer-comedy-fundraiser-8"}
X-SOURCE-ID:yohomo
SUMMARY:Friends of Roxy - A Queer Comedy Fundraiser!
DTSTART:20261004T203000
DTEND:20261004T203000
UID:46b2a4e2a7351023aca2baee4125dd06@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Toronto&#x27\;s top queer and allied comedians take the stage 
 to raise funds for people living with HIV / AIDs! Toronto! Come out for a 
 hilarious night of queer comedy raising money for a great cause! This show
  features Toronto&#x27\;s top 2SLGBTQIA+ comics taking the stage to raise 
 funds for Friends for Life bike rally\, supporting people living with HIV/
 AIDs. Doors at 8 pm\, show from 8:30 - 10 pm. Right in the heart of the Vi
 llage at Pegasus on Church! All welcome\, including allies! Admission is f
 ree with donations gratefully accepted for the Friends for Life bike rally
  to support people living with HIV/AIDS. Donate here on Eventbrite or with
  cash in person at the event. Will it be weird if I come solo? Nope! Feel 
 free to pop in\, watch some comedy\, and dip after if you aren&#x27\;t fee
 ling social. If you&#x27\;re looking to mingle and maybe have a meet cute\
 , feel free to introduce yourself to other audience members and / or some 
 of the comedians - everyone is really really nice. This is all about commu
 nity and supporting queer artists! Questions? Want to come out but are a l
 il nervous? Totally feel free to reach out to us on Instagram at @friendso
 froxycomedy - its all about community! See you there? 🤠🌈 --- The ven
 ue: The show takes place in the main area of Pegasus - head up the stairs 
 and grab a seat in the front area with the stage The performance space and
  washrooms are up a flight of stairs. Once inside\, there is no grade chan
 ge. Unfortunately there is no lift or elevator All washrooms are gender in
 clusive Seating is self-assigned Community: All are welcome at this event\
 , including allies\, that recognize this is a queer space where we are inc
 lusive and respectful of one another\, and where oppressive behaviour won&
 #x27\;t fly At this show we don&#x27\;t punch down\, and isms\, phobias\, 
 and aggressive crowd work will never be tolerated. The show is hosted and 
 produced by a queer\, nonbinary comedian who takes this seriously AF\, and
  all the comedians agree to guidelines to keep the vibes cute and inclusiv
 e This show will be fun filled and full of friendly queers\, and the audie
 nce and comedian can make new friends and mix and mingle afterwards. If yo
 u are flying solo\, are nervous\, or have any questions\, feel free to DM 
 us at @friendsofroxy We all want a sexy\, healthy time! You are totally we
 lcome to wear a mask. If you are feeling sick\, please stay home! We&#x27\
 ;d be stoked if you rapid tested before the show. ‍
LOCATION:Pegasus\, 489B Church St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/friends-of-roxy---a-queer-comedy-fundraise
 r-8
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
