DESCRIPTION:Get moving and join our steps challenge during Fall Well-Being
  Week! Whether you’re walking across campus\, taking the stairs to class
  or getting out for an activity with friends\, every step counts. Set your
  own goal and challenge yourself to move a little more each day. Challenge
  runs Monday\, October 5-Friday\, October 9. A winner for a Glendon prize 
 pack will be randomly chosen from all student participants.\nOrganized by 
 Office of Student Affairs\, Glendon.\nFormat: Hybrid\nAudience: Glendon St
 udents\, Staff and Faculty\nRegister Online\n
