SUMMARY:De las Nubes a Aquí / From the Clouds to Here
DTSTART:20261005T140000Z
DTEND:20261016T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260924T202600Z
UID:MEC-5f0d57632c4ac1fac07a1fc7b2c449fb@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261005T140000Z
SEQUENCE:13
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 09/lasn2.jpg
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp\; Design
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260924
DESCRIPTION:Sensorium ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/sensorium/ )\, AMPD ( https:
 //ampd.yorku.ca/ ) and York International ( https://www.yorku.ca/internati
 onal/ ) are thrilled to present: De las Nubes a Aquí / From the Clouds to
  Here.\nIn May 2026\, 23 York University students travelled to Costa Rica 
 to take part in the PANF 3030/5030 Global Eco-Arts Residency Course. This 
 10-day intensive course comprised a series of workshops\, gallery tours\, 
 creative class-based exercises\, community interactions\, and participatio
 n in a local community festival at York University’s Las Nubes Eco-Campu
 s and surrounding areas. Through these experiences\, students were introdu
 ced to themes of environmental and community-based art\, food sovereignty\
 , site-specific art\, and the ethics of community engagement.\nDe la Nubes
  a Aquí/ From the Clouds to Here highlights some of the student-created a
 rt that was inspired by this course and the Las Nubes Eco-Campus in Costa 
 Rica.\nDATES: October 5 – 16\, 2026 | Opening Reception: October 8 (6:00
  – 8:00 p.m.)\nTIME: 10:00 a.m. – 4:00 p.m.\nLOCATION: Gales Gallery (
  https://virtualtour.ampd.yorku.ca/yorku/visual-art-art-history/gales-gall
 ery )\, 105 Accolade West\, Keele Campus\nFREE Admission\nRSVP HERE ( http
 s://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSconKYbF7Pz9NV1hue14RPZE5d92y6BQM2cu9
 F3YBRApAVW7A/viewform )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924
LOCATION:Gales Gallery\, 105 Accolade West Building (ACW)\, York Universit
 y @ 89 York Blvd.\, Toronto
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/de-las-nubes-a-aqui/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
