DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261005T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261005T190000
UID:6a567224daaaf4f51a1fba6f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively and fun discussion about the selected boo
 k of the month.\nThis book club has relocated to Main Street Branch during
  Dawes Road Branch's closure. New club members are welcome. Each month's s
 election will be available for checkout after the previous month's meetin
 g.\nAugust 10 :\nThe Museum of Extraordinary Things\nby Alice Hoffman\nSep
