UID:6aabe94265abe8002a79ec35@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Navigating self-employment in a new country can be challenging
 \, but this workshop will equip newly immigrated entrepreneurs with the es
 sential financial tools to succeed in Canada. This workshop is designed to
  build your confidence in managing your business finances and help you thr
 ive as a self-employed professional in Canada. Perfect for newcomers looki
 ng to establish a solid financial foundation.​\nThis program is part of 
 Small Business Month and the Newcomer Entrepreneurship Initiative.\nRegist
 er on tpl.ca or by calling 416-396-8992.
