SUMMARY:Fall Well-Being Week: Climate Fresk & Climate Café
DTSTART:20261005T183000Z
DTEND:20261005T213000Z
DTSTAMP:20260929T131800Z
UID:MEC-fc75bd9622425bbc421653770069faf5@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261005T183000Z
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 9/image-5.png
CATEGORIES:Sustainability,Well-being Week
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:Part of Fall Well-Being Week\, this event combines two proven 
 approaches to engaging with climate change.\nClimate Fresk is an interacti
 ve workshop that helps participants understand the science\, causes and im
 pacts of climate change through collaborative learning. Using information 
 based on IPCC research\, you’ll work with others to explore how climate 
 systems are connected and gain a deeper understanding of today’s climate
  challenges.\nClimate Café provides a safe space to talk about how you ar
 e being impacted\, share thoughts and feelings\, and begin to identify how
  you can take meaningful climate action.\nTogether\, this combined event g
 ives you the knowledge you need\, helps you process the emotions you have 
 and builds your resilience to take action for the benefit of you\, your co
 mmunity and our planet. Help us test out this novel idea while developing 
 your skills and having fun! Drinks and snacks will be provided.\nHosted by
  WIL – Wellness Impact Lab and the Office of Sustainability.\nSpots are 
 limited. Event location details will be shared with registered participant
 s. Register here ( https://sustainability.apps01.yorku.ca/machform/view.ph
 p?id=62961 ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929
ORGANIZER;CN="Office of Sustainability":MAILTO:sustainability@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/fall-well-being-week-climate-fresk-clim
 ate-cafe/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/climate-cafe-climate-fresk-event/"}
