UID:MEC-37eda6fc55724f196e07626ad6bf49c8@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261005T183000Z
SEQUENCE:3
CATEGORIES:Sustainability,Well-being,Well-being Week
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260928
DESCRIPTION:The collaborative Climate Café & Climate Fresk combines two p
 roven approaches to engaging about climate change:\nClimate Fresk is an in
 teractive workshop that helps participants understand the science\, causes
 \, and impacts of climate change through collaborative learning. Using inf
 ormation based on IPCC research\, you’ll work with others to explore how
  climate systems are connected and gain a deeper understanding of today’
 s climate challenges.Climate Café provides a safe space to talk about how
  you are being impacted\, share thoughts and feelings\, and begin to ident
 ify how you can take meaningful climate action.\nTogether this combined ev
 ent gives you the knowledge you need\, process the emotions you have and b
 uilds your resilience to take action for the benefit of you\, your communi
 ty and our planet.\nHelp us test out this novel idea\, while developing yo
 ur skills and having fun! Drinks and snacks will be provided.\n—\nMonday
  5th October\, 2026 – 2:30 PM\nOrganized by WIL – Wellness Impact Lab 
 and The Office of Sustainability.\nFormat: In-Person\nAudience: York Commu
 nity\nLimited Spots available – We will contact you with the event detai
 ls following your registration.\nRegister Online\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
