 ted Study Sessions\, Tutoring\, and Office Hours are typically not offered
 . If a session is scheduled during this period\, details will be communica
 ted by the course instructor and posted in eClass.\nLearn more about PASS 
 ( https://students.yorku.ca/PASS ).\n
