SEQUENCE:8
CATEGORIES:LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&amp\;PS Community Hub,LA&amp\;PS Founder
 s College,LA&amp\;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp\;PS New College,LA&amp\;PS 
 Student Success,LA&amp\;PS Students All,LA&amp\;PS Students-International,
 LA&amp\;PS Students-Undergrad,LA&amp\;PS Vanier College
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260902
DESCRIPTION:Are you a 2nd\, 3rd or 4th year LA&PS student weighing the pro
 s and cons of graduate studies but feel overwhelmed by the application pro
 cess\, expectations\, and other unknowns? Join our upcoming grad school in
 fo session and get the clarity and confidence you need to make an informed
  decision about your academic future.\nRegister Now\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260903
LOCATION:305 Founders College
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
