BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/recovery-college-week-2-finding-self-compassion-dealing-with-growing-pains/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Recovery College: YU & Balance Week 2 | Finding self-compassion an
 d dealing with growing pains
DTSTART:20261006T160000Z
DTEND:20261006T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T132200Z
UID:MEC-1bbd8746b185f6d539461fc40141577a@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261006T160000Z
SEQUENCE:5
CATEGORIES:Athletics &amp\; Recreation,Bethune College,Calumet College,Col
 leges,Divisions and Special Areas,Faculties,Faculty of Health,Faculty of L
 iberal Arts &amp\; Professional Studies,Faculty of Science,Glendon,Health 
 Education &amp\; Promotion,Learning Commons,Learning Skills Services,Stong
  College,Student Counselling, Health &amp\; Well-being,Students,Well-being
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260901
DESCRIPTION:Growth does not always mean having everything figured out.\nTh
 is week’s session of YU & Balance is about giving yourself room to explo
 re your interests\, set goals that feel meaningful and recognize that resp
 onsibilities and personal ambitions can exist together. Students will be a
 ble to take a closer look at where they are now and where they would like 
 to go\, while also considering the role self-compassion plays when plans c
 hange\, mistakes happen or progress feels slow. What would you pursue if y
 ou gave yourself permission to try? And what would it look like to support
  yourself along the way instead of criticizing every setback?\nThis sessio
 n is part of a 6-week Recovery College series. For each session attended\,
  participants will receive $5 on their YU-card. To receive the gift card\,
  you must attend the full session (approximately 45–60 minutes). Unfortu
 nately\, we’re not able to provide gift cards for partial attendance. Gi
 ft cards will be emailed after the session to the same email address used 
 to register and join the session.\nSpace is limited\, and registration is 
 offered on a first-come\, first-served basis. If the session is full and y
 ou’d like to be added to the waitlist\, please email hstacey@yorku.ca ( 
 mailto:hstacey@yorku.ca ). We’ll reach out if a spot becomes available. 
 If you’re registered but can no longer attend\, please let us know as so
 on as you can so we can offer your spot to another student.\nRegister for 
 Finding Self-Compassion & Dealing with Growing Pains ( https://yorku.zoom.
 us/meeting/register/Oz-WJVScTWit3Eak7kgDZw#/registration )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001
LOCATION:Online (Zoom)
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/recovery-college-week-2-finding-self-co
 mpassion-dealing-with-growing-pains/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
