SUMMARY:Pumpkin Pages: A Kids’ Fall Craft
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T170000
UID:6a8600e429a7dd0d67451e72@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Calling all young artists and book lovers! Join us for a fun a
 nd creative fall craft where we’ll turn recycled book pages into a cute 
 pumpkin decoration. Kids will fold\, create\, and decorate their own book-
 art pumpkin while exploring their creativity and celebrating the magic of 
