SUMMARY:Murder Mystery Double Book Launch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T190000
UID:bm-6488120261006@shop.benmcnallybooks.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn1.bookmanager.com/i/7600763/Website2/
 Events/10_06_26.png?cb=1790884089
DESCRIPTION:[at Ben McNally Books]\nJoin us at Ben McNally Books\, as we c
 elebrate the launches of two murder mysteries:\nA Killing Cold\nby Alice F
 itzpatrick\, and\nMurder by Nordic Design\nby A.L. Jensen\nAbout the Books
 :\nA Killing Cold\nTHE THIRD BOOK IN THE MEREDITH ISLAND MYSTERIES\nIt’s
  Christmas on Meredith Island\, and Kate Galway is looking forward to spen
 ding some mother-daughter time with her barrister daughter\, Alex.  But Ka
 te is forced to adjust her plans when Alex arrives accompanied by her fath
 er\, Detective Chief Inspector James Hewitt\, Kate’s ex-husband.  The is
 land’s matriarch\, Sophie Sutherland\, is eager to reunite with her old 
 beau\, Teddy Bartell\, who shows up with an entourage of relations\, inclu
 ding his son\, the son’s abrasive second wife\, and her twin brother.\nE
 veryone joins in the Christmas celebrations at the pub\, but the party com
 es to an abrupt end when someone ingests a lethal dose of cyanide.  A wint
 er storm has shut down access to the mainland\, trapping the killer on the
  island.  With no forensics and minimal support from the mainland police\,
  James\, Kate\, and Alex must rely on old-fashioned detective work to trac
 k down the murderer before they strike again.\nMurder by Nordic Design\nA 
 Hygge House Nordic Cozy Mystery \n\n​\nLakewood’s Fall Fair is fast ap
 proaching\, but when Minna finds a dead body\, can she catch a killer befo
 re the town’s biggest event becomes its deadliest?\n\n\nHygge House kick
 s into high gear for Lakewood’s most popular annual event. Minna Halonen
  and her best friend and business partner Christie Andersson prepare for t
 he onslaught of tourists while James’s crew works to finish their new sa
 una in time.\nAs part of the fair’s planning committee\, Elsi buzzes aro
 und town\, while Sofia’s social media side hustle is turning into a real
  job.\n\n​\n\nOn the day of the Fall Fair\, Minna invites her guests to 
 christen the newly built sauna\, only to be stunned when she discovers the
  corpse of a carpenter. A fair’s opening has never been so foul.\nMurder
  by Nordic Design\nis the third book in the delightful Hygge House Mystery
  series—where murder meets Nordic comfort in a rustic northern town.
LOCATION:Ben McNally Books
URL:https://shop.benmcnallybooks.com/events
X-SOURCE:Ben McNally Books
END:VEVENT
