SUMMARY:Ace the Interview: Software Engineering Interview Prep with Veeva
  Systems
DTSTART:20261006T190000Z
DTEND:20261006T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260920T223100Z
UID:MEC-6b5fad0d3a729d65ebfec0ec9f536fac@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261006T190000Z
SEQUENCE:8
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp\; Career Centre,Interview Prep (CCC),Job Search (CCC
 ),Networking Opportunities (CCC)
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260920
DESCRIPTION:Software Engineering Students: \nJoin Veeva Systems for an in
 teractive workshop designed to equip you with actionable strategies to con
 quer both technical and behavioral interview stages.\nWhat to Expect\n\nDi
 scover Veeva: Learn about Veeva’s mission as a Public Benefit Corpor
 ation\, the Engineering Development Program (EDP)\, and upcoming entry-le
 vel opportunities.\nResume & Application Process: Sharing best practices 
 on how to prepare your resume and application before hitting submit!\nTec
 hnical Interview Breakdown: Get expert tips on navigating online coding a
 ssessments\, communicating your thought process out loud\, managing time c
 omplexity\, and leveraging resources like LeetCode and NeetCode.\nBehavior
 al Deep Dive: Discover how to stand out by structuring your “origin sto
 ry\,” tying your project experiences to core company values\, and master
 ing the STAR framework.\nLive Q&A & Breakout Networking: Ask questions di
 rectly to Veeva’s team and build your network in small-group breakout r
 ooms.\n\nWho Should Attend? Students interested in Associate Software Engi
 neer or Intern Software Engineer positions\, now or in the future.\n\nRegi
 ster Here [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″] ( https:/
 /yorku-csm.symplicity.com/students/?s=event&ss=is&mode=form&id=1815f22bfd8
 0c9ff1330652b77696bbb )\nTo register\, you must log in to Experience York 
 ( https://experience.yorku.ca/ ) with your Passport York credentials.\n \
 n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929
LOCATION:DB 1014\, Victor Phillip Dahdaleh Building
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
