 l-being,Well-being Week
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260917
DESCRIPTION:Take a well deserved break and join the ACMAPS & BE YU teams f
 or a relaxing and uplifting Puppy Therapy session designed specifically fo
 r students during well-being week. This welcoming event offers a chance to
  unwind\, connect with others\, and enjoy the comfort of spending time wit
 h friendly\, playful pups. Animal assisted activities have been shown to r
 educe anxiety\, ease feelings of loneliness\, boost motivation\, and provi
 de emotional comfort. Whether you’re balancing academics\, parenting\, o
 r both\, this is a wonderful opportunity to de stress in a supportive envi
 ronment. Children are welcome to attend with their student parent. Come me
 et some adorable four legged friends and give yourself a moment of calm—
 you deserve it.\n\nOrganized by Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-Time S
 tudents (ACMAPS) Team & The Black Excellence Program (BE YU Team).\n\nForm
 at: In-Person Event\nAudience: York Community\nRegister Online\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/paws-pause-puppy-therapy/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
