BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Civic Tech Toronto": "https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-563-canadian-9q3r8p"}
X-SOURCE-ID:guildhost_civic_tech
SUMMARY:Civic Meetup #563: Canadian Council Records: Nothing but PDFs\, an
 d Toronto
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T210000
UID:b73b37703ab1be49521c097862c7f0da@guild.host
DESCRIPTION:Venue confirmed: Health Sciences Building (University of Toron
 to)\, Room 108\, 155 College St. Please note: this is not Myhal Centre as 
 originally listed.\n\nTopic: Canadian Council Records: Nothing but PDFs\, 
 and Toronto\n\nMost Canadian municipalities publish their council record a
 s PDFs\, sometimes scanned.\n\nA handful of SaaS vendors cover roughly 500
  cities between them\; the rest are a long tail of one-off formats\, and t
 hen there's Toronto\, whose minutes are a breath of fresh air.\n\nMike wil
 l show what it took to build a searchable record across both.\n\nSpeaker: 
 Mike Nikles (he/him)\n\nMike is the solo developer behind Civic Lens\, a s
 earchable record of Canadian council meetings\, bylaws and municipal spend
 ing\, built from the cities' own documents and traced back to source.\n\nA
 genda:\n\n7:00-7:20 Welcome and Introductions\n\n7:20-7:50 Presentation an
 d Q\\&A/discussion\n\n7:50-9:00 Breakout groups\n\n‎\n\nCode of Conduct:
  https://civictech.ca/about-us\n\n‎\n\nCheck in with us on the Civic Tec
 h Toronto Slack: https://link.civictech.ca/chat\n\n‎\n\nAbout Us:\n\nOur
  weekly civic meetups bring together Torontonians (designers\, coders\, ur
 ban planners\, government staff\, mappers\, policy-makers\, students\, com
 munications strategists\, community organizers\, and more) who share an in
 terest in making Toronto more responsive\, prosperous\, sustainable\, and 
 equitable through design\, tech\, and data.\n\nCome and be part of it!\n\n
 For more info: https://civictech.ca\n\n\\--\n\nInterested in speaking at a
  future event\, or know someone who'd be a great speaker? We'd love to hea
 r from you:\n\nhttps://link.civictech.ca/speaker-suggestions\n\nHave a spa
 ce that could host up to 80 civic-minded folks for an evening? Consider re
 commending your venue:\n\nhttps://link.civictech.ca/venue-suggestions\n
LOCATION:Online: https://link.civictech.ca/zoom / Health Sciences Building
URL:https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-563-canadian-9q3r8p
X-SOURCE:Civic Tech Toronto
END:VEVENT
