SUMMARY: “At Home” films by Robert Beavers and Ute Aurand
DESCRIPTION:Join Ute Aurand and Robert Beavers in person for a two-day pr
 ogram of screenings and discussion exploring affinities between cinema an
 d architecture through their work.\n\nPartners of twenty years and two of
  experimental cinema's most distinctive voices\, Aurand and Beavers have 
 rarely had their films presented in dialogue. "At Home" (Oct. 6) explores
  domestic space and interior life.\n\n“At Home” will be followed by a Q&A
  with Grant Weidenfeld and Chris Kennedy.\n\nMore Info: www.daniels.utoro
 nto.ca/events/1791172800/film-screening-aurand-beavers-architecture-and-d
 welling https://www.daniels.utoronto.ca/events/1791172800/film-screening-
