SUMMARY:Intermediate Sewing: Box Corner Pencil Case
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T120000
UID:6aa9dd69a5dbde002aa4e090@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Want to further develop your sewing skills? Our intermediate s
 ewing class will take what was learned in sewing basics and add more compl
 ex elements such as a zipper and boxed corners. We will be creating a smal
 l pencil case with a functioning zipper. All materials will be provided.\
 nNOTE\n: Knowledge of sewing is required. Sewing basics instruction will n
 ot be included.\nChildren under 13 must be accompanied by an adult.\nRegis
 tration is required.\nRegistration starts on September 23\, 2026 @ 12:30pm
 \nNote: Your spot will not be guaranteed after 5 minutes of the start of t
 he program.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on t
 his form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libra
 ries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only b
