DESCRIPTION:York University’s Master of Athletic Therapy (MAT) is a full
 -time\, six-term graduate program offered through the School of Kinesiolog
 y & Health Science in the Faculty of Health. Designed to meet the evolving
  demands of the athletic therapy profession\, the MAT combines rigorous ac
 ademic coursework with extensive clinical and field-based learning experie
 nces. Join a virtual drop-in session to connect directly with MAT faculty\
 , learn more about the program\, and get answers to your program and admis
 sions questions.\nZOOM LINK TO JOIN: yorku.zoom.us/my/matinfo ( https://yo
 rku.zoom.us/my/matinfo )\n\n\nUPCOMING DROP-IN SESSIONS:\n\nSeptember 23\,
  10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nSeptember 30\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nOctober 7\, 10:0
 0 to 11:00 a.m.\nOctober 13\, 9:00 to 10:00 a.m.\nOctober 16\, 1:00 to 2:0
 0 p.m.\nOctober 16\, 3:00 to 4:00 p.m.\nOctober 21\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\n
 October 28\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nNovember 4\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\nNovemb
 er 11\, 10:00 to 11:00 a.m.\n\n\n\n
