DESCRIPTION:Shibori is a traditional Japanese tie-dye method that uses fol
 ding\, twisting\, stitching and binding. It creates detailed indigo\, blu
 e and white patterns by stopping dye from soaking into parts of the cloth.
  Participants will create a beautiful scarf/sarong to take home and enjoy.
