SUMMARY:First Year Lunch Break: Create a Motivation Board (in collab with 
 Academic Honesty)
DTSTART:20261007T163000Z
DTEND:20261007T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20260902T173800Z
UID:MEC-27816fed47150f6fda5f96e75013749f@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261007T163000Z
SEQUENCE:4
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp\; Professional Studies,LA&amp\;PS 
 Colleges,LA&amp\;PS Founders College,LA&amp\;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp\
 ;PS New College,LA&amp\;PS Vanier College
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260902
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin us for a relaxing First Year Lunch Break\, where you ca
 n enjoy a free meal\, connect with fellow first-year students\, and create
  a personalized motivation board or bookmark to keep you inspired througho
 ut the semester. As midterms approach\, take a moment to reflect on your g
 oals\, celebrate your progress\, and fill your board or bookmark with enco
 uraging quotes\, affirmations\, reminders\, and aspirations that will help
  you stay focused and motivated. We’ll provide all the supplies you need
  to design a board that reflects what drives you\, whether it’s academic
  success\, personal growth\, self-care\, or future ambitions. This is also
  a great opportunity to unwind\, enjoy meaningful conversations\, and buil
 d new friendships in a welcoming\, low-pressure environment. Leave feeling
  refreshed\, re-energized\, and ready to tackle the rest of the semester w
 ith confidence.\nRegister Now\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928
LOCATION:MC014
ORGANIZER;CN="Bhanu Priya Sharma":MAILTO:
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://forms.cloud.microsoft/pages/responsepage.aspx?id=GBNTNBFw1E-H8
 KQ4FsSb0KiiOcKC3hVKuD7DvmSHyblUODhJU1hOTlNUNVAwOFZGQzFYR1cyT09JTiQlQCN0PWc
 u&OR=EXCEL-WEB.BODY.NT&CT=1788194329051&route=shorturl
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
