  how to use WordPress to build your own e-commerce or small business websi
 te. This session workshop will cover everything from the basic fundamental
 s and tools of WordPress all the way to the platform's advanced features t
 hat support promoting and running a small business.\nThis program takes pl
 ace during Digital Inclusion Week 2026.\n(\nPlease arrive a few minutes ea
 rly.\nPlease cancel as soon as possible if you are no longer available to 
 attend\n.)\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on th
