UID:evt-BvrOdjRGSmQyQbh
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/am/3cf6c34b-8
 a8b-4964-b050-37aa222274c9.png
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by: The AI Collective\, Ioana Mihăilescu\, Cristi Movi
 lă\, Ioana Ioanas\, Irina Raicu\, Virgil Ilian\, Roxana Chiriacescu\n\nTi
