 liday\n**BOOK CHANGE**\nThurs. Oct. 8\, 2:00-4:00pm\nAmerican Alt by Chris
  Lockhart\n**BOOK CHANGE**\nThurs. Nov. 12\, 2:00-4:00pm\nShock Doctrine b
 y Naomi Klein
