DESCRIPTION:Audience: LAPS\, AMPD and Lassonde students from the Markham c
 ampus that are intending to begin their first co-op work term in Summer 20
 27\n\nInformation Session: Oct. 8\, 2-3:30pm\n\nRegister Here [icon name=
