SUMMARY:Navigating Essential Financial Tools for Newcomer Entrepreneurs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261008T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261008T200000
UID:6a90738c6383850d1b2453d3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​Navigating self-employment in a new country can be challeng
 ing\, but this workshop will equip newly immigrated entrepreneurs (and new
  entrepreneurs in general) with the essential financial tools to succeed i
 n Canada. This workshop is designed to build your confidence in managing y
 our business finances and help you thrive as a self-employed professional 
 in Canada. Perfect for newcomers looking to establish a solid financial fo
