DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261009T150000
UID:6ab18c7aa5dbde002aa6451c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in deepening your connection to Toronto's 
 civic history\, fostering meaningful conversations with one another\, and 
 building a stronger shared sense of community identity? If so\, join us fo
 r a fun round of Trivia\, celebrating democracy!\nRefreshments will be ser
 ved.\nDrop In.\nToronto's municipal election takes place on October 26\, 2
 026. Check out the\nKnowYourVote.TO\nwebsite and the\nCelebrate Democracy\
 npage to learn more about the upcoming election\, access important voter r
 esources\, and discover more activities and interactive library programs f
 or all ages happening at a branch near you.\nThis initiative is made possi
 ble by donations to the Toronto Public Library Foundation and is generousl
 y supported by the McConnell Foundation.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab18c7aa5dbde002aa6451c
