SUMMARY:Navigating the Healthcare System: Know Your Options. Know Your Rig
 hts.
DTSTART:20261009T153000Z
DTEND:20261009T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260915T163100Z
UID:MEC-fb22fb2b63ebd0f8261cbfc4809cd152@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261009T153000Z
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Well-being,Well-being Week
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Not sure where to go when you need medical care? Wondering whe
 ther to visit a walk-in clinic\, urgent care\, the emergency department\, 
 or whether a pharmacist or virtual care provider can help?\nJoin the YFS W
 ellness Centre and Nurse Decoded for an interactive workshop designed to h
 elp students confidently navigate Ontario’s healthcare system and access
  the right care at the right time.\nTopics include:\nUnderstanding your he
 althcare options (family physicians\, nurse practitioners\, physician assi
 stants\, pharmacists\, virtual care\, walk-in clinics\, urgent care\, and 
 emergency departments)\nKnowing your rights as a patient and how to advoca
 te for yourself\nAccessing mental health services and crisis supports\nUnd
 erstanding what happens during a mental health crisis\, including common p
 rocesses under Ontario’s Mental Health Act\nWhen and how to seek a secon
 d opinion or access alternative healthcare services\nPractical tips to hel
 p you navigate the healthcare system with confidence\nWhether you’re new
  to Ontario\, living away from home for the first time\, or simply want to
  better understand how to access healthcare\, this session will provide pr
 actical\, real-world information that every student can use.\nOrganized by
  YFS Wellness Centre\nLocation: Rm 109 Second Student Centre\n\nFormat: Dr
 op-In In-Person Event\nAudience: York Community\n\n\n \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/navigating-the-healthcare-system-know-y
 our-options-know-your-rights/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
