X-SOURCE:Bata Shoe Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261009T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261009T210000
DTSTAMP:20260914T172940Z
CREATED:20250715T183315Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260914T172940Z
UID:16744-1791565200-1791579600@batashoemuseum.ca
SUMMARY:Late Night At The BSM: Sketching
DESCRIPTION:Date: Friday\, October 9\, 2026\nTime: 5:00 pm – 9:00 pm\nLocation: Bata Shoe Museum\, 327 Bloor St. W.\nTickets: included with General Admission \nNEW! Every second Friday of the month until the end of 2026\, we will remain open until 9 pm (we usually close at 5 pm!) for all to enjoy\, with special free programming new each week plus access to all current exhibitions.  \nThis week: Sketching inspired by André Perugia: A Design Legend Unveiled \nJoin us for an evening of sketching the incredible footwear and fashion on display throughout the museum. Whether you’re an experienced artist or just looking to try something new\, this relaxed drop-in program offers a perfect blend of art\, atmosphere\, and imagination. \nNo experience needed\, and all materials are provided. You are welcome to bring your own dry mediums\, such as pencils and pencil crayons. Drop in\, have some fun\, and take home your own design.  \nBUY YOUR TICKETS  \nPlease review our Terms and Conditions in advance and check in with Visitor Services upon arrival. Questions? Email us info@batashoemuseum.ca anytime.
URL:https://batashoemuseum.ca/event/late-night-at-the-bsm-sketching/
CATEGORIES:Drop In Activity,Front Page,Special Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://batashoemuseum.ca/wp-content/uploads/BSM_Sketching_banner.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/resume-fundamentals-for-co-op-in-person-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Resume Fundamentals for Co-op (In-Person)
DTSTART:20261009T170000Z
DTEND:20261009T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20261002T191600Z
UID:MEC-ba1ded3b4a24fb934f53571fb56151d6@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261009T170000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Co-op &amp\; Career Centre,Co-op Mandatory Sessions (CCC),Infor
 mation Sessions (CCC),Resume Fundamentals
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261002
DESCRIPTION:The York University Co-op Program provides students with oppor
 tunities for paid\, hands-on learning and valuable industry experience. We
  encourage you to visit the Co-operative Education website to review progr
 am details and confirm that you meet the academic requirements.\nResume Fu
 ndamentals for Co-op\nThe session will cover several fundamental resume to
 pics to help you prepare for your co-op job search including:\n\nResume an
 d cover letter basics\nEmployers’ expectations in a co-op resume and cov
 er letter\nTips for resume format\, content\, and do’s and don’ts that
  specifically target co-op level positions.\n\nJoin in Person:\nFriday\, O
 ctober 9\n2:00 p.m. – 3:00 p.m.\n1014 Victor Phillip Dahdelah Building\n
 Register Here [icon name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″]\n \n
