DESCRIPTION:Leaky taps\, pests or issues with your tenancy? Get informed b
 efore small problems escalate.\nJoin CLASP ( https://www.yorku.ca/osgoode/
 clasp/ )\, York’s on-campus legal clinic\, for a practical\, student-foc
 used legal information session that breaks down rights and responsibilitie
 s as a tenant. Learn about maintenance issues\, notices and what to expect
  during a Landlord and Tenant Board (LTB) hearing. Led by supervising law
 yer Anum Malik and CLASP law students.\nDate: Friday\, October 9\nTime: 1:
 30 to 3PM\nLocation: First Student Centre\, Room 307\nYou’re welcome to 
 drop in\, but if you think you’ll be coming\, please register. Registrat
 ion helps us plan for enough food\, without so much that it goes to waste.
  It also lets us account for allergies and dietary preferences\, so everyo
 ne can enjoy the snacks safely.\nRegister for Rent Ready! ( https://forms.
 students.yorku.ca/view.php?id=506383 )\n
