SUMMARY:Healthcare Careers Decoded: Is This the Right Program for Me?
DTSTART:20261009T180000Z
DTEND:20261009T193000Z
DTSTAMP:20260915T163400Z
UID:MEC-991eadc4a0783c27d2ef14ba5924c651@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261009T180000Z
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Well-being,Well-being Week
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Not sure if you’re in the right program? Wondering what care
 ers are actually available in healthcare beyond the ones you hear about mo
 st? Thinking about transferring programs\, pursuing graduate studies\, or 
 exploring a different direction?\nJoin the YFS Wellness Centre and Nurse D
 ecoded for an honest and interactive conversation exploring the many pathw
 ays into healthcare and how to determine which profession may be the right
  fit for you.\nThe session will feature healthcare professionals from a va
 riety of disciplines sharing their personal journeys\, career realities\, 
 and lessons learned\, followed by an open audience discussion where no que
 stion is off limits.\nTopics include:\nWhat different healthcare professio
 nals actually do\nCareer pathways\, educational requirements\, and opportu
 nities for growth\nTransferable skills and how one degree can lead to many
  different careers\nChanging directions\, returning to school\, and career
  pivots\nCommon misconceptions about healthcare professions\nAdvice for st
 udents questioning whether they’re in the right program\nLive audience Q
 &A with healthcare professionals\nWhether you’re considering nursing\, r
 ehabilitation\, mental health\, medicine\, allied health\, public health\,
  or simply exploring your options\, this session is designed to help you m
 ake more informed decisions about your future with confidence.\nOrganized 
 by YFS Wellness Centre\nLocation: Rm 109 Second Student Centre\n\nFormat: 
 Drop-In In-Person Event\nAudience: York Community\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260915
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/healthcare-careers-decoded-is-this-the-
 right-program-for-me/
