DESCRIPTION:Address:\nThe Annex Hotel\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nCan you bel
 ieve it’s been 10 years since Insecure first aired? A true classic that 
 somehow never gets old. And since the anniversary tour wasn’t making its
  way to Toronto\, we decided to host our own in collaboration w/ Joelle .\
 nWhether you’re insecure about wine and want to explore it without all t
 he pretension\, or you simply want to enjoy Insecure over wine\, this one
 ’s for you.\nWe’ll sip through three wines\, revisit three moments fro
 m the show\, and get into the hot takes\, questionable decisions\, and con
 versations that Insecure always seems to bring out.\n\nWhat’s Included:\
 n‘We Got Ya’ll’ …\n\nHosted by Link up
