 oters.\nCheck out\nKids Vote Weekend\n(KVW)\, a fun event hosted by Toront
 o Elections.\nDrop in. No registration is required.\nToronto's municipal e
 lection takes place on October 26\, 2026. Check out the\nKnowYourVote.TO\n
 website and the\nCelebrate Democracy\npage to learn more about the upcomin
 g election\, access important voter resources\, and discover activities an
 d interactive library programs for all ages happening at a branch near you
