SUMMARY:Music on the River- ft. Jennie Laws
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nJam wit
 h us in ours boats to Jennie Laws' tunes! To book your spot\, please go to
  the link:\n*[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-t
 he-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-
 river/)*\nLink shows live boat availability and options!\n\nLocated on Tor
 onto’s beautiful Humber River our Music On The River event starts at our
  Humber Paddling centre which is only a 5-Minute walk from Old Mill TTC St
 ation! Upon arrival we’ll get you signed in and set you up with your boa
 t and equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of the meandering 
 Humber River before enjoying a 45-Minute set from Popular Local Toronto Ar
 tists!\n\n**Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our con
 trol. If we must cancel or delay an event we will let you know as soon as 
 possible.**\n\n**Booking and Pricing:**\n[https://torontoadventures.ca/all
 -adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-ad
 ventures/music-shows-on-the-river/)\nSingle Kayak (seats 1 person) : $49.9
 5 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (se
 ats 2 people) : $79.95 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +taxe
 s\nStand Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nSeat in a Voyageur Can
 oe (1 person) : $39.95 +taxes\nBring Your Own Boat (boat/equipment): $9.95
  +taxes\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD(s) “Lif
 ejackets”\n* A concert right on the river!\n* Our experienced staff to h
 elp you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the we
 ather!\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses & Hats\, are all recommended for sunny da
 ys!\n* We recommend securely fastened footwear (footwear is not required f
 or SUPs).\n* Blanket to keep you cozy during the show\n* Snacks & Drinks (
 Non Alcoholic)\n* Don’t forget your Cameras!\n\n**[Google Link Direction
 s](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverlocation)**\n**[Can
 cellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**[ ](htt
 ps://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)\n\nWe hope to see you out on 
 the water!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/316527438/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260912T143102Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260912T143102Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
