ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/09
 /Chandni-aspect-ratio-1600-1000.jpg?resize=1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:Some films are remembered. Some films become part of our memor
 ies.\n\nThe Aga Khan Museum is proud to partner with Classic Legends India
 n Films Festival (CLIFF) — a celebration of Indian cinema\, bringing tog
 ether timeless classics\, acclaimed contemporary films\, distinguished fil
 mmakers\, and engaging conversations. The festival honours India’s rich 
 cinematic legacy while creating a global platform for screenings\, retrosp
 ectives\, cultural exchange\, and dialogue between cinema\, literature\, a
 nd the performing arts.\n\nOpening CLIFF 2026’s Romantic Ravivaar at the
  Aga Khan Museum\, this screening offers audiences an opportunity to revis
 it Chandni as it was meant to be experienced — together\, on the big scr
 een\, surrounded by fellow lovers of Indian cinema.
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/chandni/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
END:VEVENT
