SUMMARY:Silsila
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261011T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261011T160000
UID:silsila-2026-10-11t16-00-00-04-00@agakhanmuseum.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/09
 /Silsila_3-aspect-ratio-1600-1000.jpg?resize=1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:Love\, marriage\, memory\, and the choices that remain with us
 .\n\nThe Aga Khan Museum is proud to partner with Classic Legends Indian F
 ilms Festival (CLIFF) — a celebration of Indian cinema\, bringing togeth
 er timeless classics\, acclaimed contemporary films\, distinguished filmma
 kers\, and engaging conversations. The festival honours India’s rich cin
 ematic legacy while creating a global platform for screenings\, retrospect
 ives\, cultural exchange\, and dialogue between cinema\, literature\, and 
 the performing arts.\n\nAs part of Romantic Ravivaar at CLIFF 2026\, Silsi
 la returns to the big screen inviting audiences to rediscover its music\, 
 poetry\, and complex exploration of love and marriage.
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/silsila/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
END:VEVENT
