SUMMARY: Maplee Retail Store Grand Opening
DESCRIPTION:A new space for little discoveries is here! 🍁✨\n\nCelebrate 
 Maplee’s grand opening in the Distillery District with Canadian brands\, 
 a DJ\, complimentary treats\, and giveaways!\n\nJoin us on Sunday\, Octob
 er 11\, to celebrate the grand opening of Maplee’s retail store in Toront
 o’s Distillery District!\n\nExplore a curated collection of Canadian bran
 ds\, discover thoughtful gifts and everyday favourites\, and meet some of
  the makers behind your finds. From accessories and handmade goods to bea
 uty\, lifestyle\, and more\, there’s plenty to fall in love with.\n\nHere
 ’s what’s happening:\n🎀 A ribbon cutting to mark this exciting new chapt
 er\n🍰 Complimentary beverages\, treats\, and special Maplee desserts\n🛍
 ️ Plenty of discoveries from Canadian brands\n🎁 A free gift with the fir
 st 50 purchases over $50\n🤝 Meet our vendors and discover the stories be
 hind their brands and products\n\nBring your friends\, come explore\, and
  celebrate with us!\n\n📅 Sunday\, October 11\, 2026\n🕛 12:00 - 6:00 PM\
 n📍 Maplee Retail Store - 15 Mill Street\, Distillery District\, Toronto\
 n\nFollow @mapleecanada and @maplee_distilleryto on Instagram for updates
  and sneak peeks.
