BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Aga Khan Museum": "https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/kabhi-kabhie/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:agakhan_museum
SUMMARY:Kabhi Kabhie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261011T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261011T200000
UID:kabhi-kabhie-2026-10-11t20-00-00-04-00@agakhanmuseum.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/09
 /Kabhi-Kabhie_2-aspect-ratio-1600-1000.jpg?resize=1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:“Love is Life.” Few films have captured the poetry of love
 \, memory and relationships quite like Kabhi Kabhie.\n\nThe Aga Khan Museu
 m is proud to partner with Classic Legends Indian Films Festival (CLIFF) 
 — a celebration of Indian cinema\, bringing together timeless classics\,
  acclaimed contemporary films\, distinguished filmmakers\, and engaging co
 nversations. The festival honours India’s rich cinematic legacy while cr
 eating a global platform for screenings\, retrospectives\, cultural exchan
 ge\, and dialogue between cinema\, literature\, and the performing arts.\n
 \nAs the concluding screening of Romantic Ravivaar at CLIFF 2026\, Kabhi K
 abhie offers audiences a chance to experience a landmark of Hindi romantic
  cinema once again – on the big screen\, with its poetry\, music and tim
 eless story of love across generations.
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/kabhi-kabhie/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
END:VEVENT
