UID:6aa9a36cab7a8e0037c205fb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of casual activities and conversation
  in a friendly and engaging atmosphere. Activities include board games\, p
 uzzles\, colouring\, and tech help. You are welcome to bring your own devi
