BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7e0bb28c7b29006f161ce2"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:Malvern Senior Social: DJ At Any Age
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T110000
UID:6a7e0bb28c7b29006f161ce2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us once a month on a Tuesday\, at the Malvern Library fo
 r our Seniors Social.\nBring out your inner DJ in this intergenerational p
 rogram for seniors and adults. Learn basic djing skills and connect with o
 thers over a shared love of music. Artist and educator Deejay Vee from At 
 Any Age will teach you how to use a dj controller and software in a fun an
 d relaxed atmosphere. Working individually or in pairs\, you'll create and
  exchange playlists of songs that represent meaningful moments in your lif
 e.\nRegistration required.\nUpcoming Dates (Tuesday):\nSept 8\, 2026\nOct 
 13\, 2026\nNov 10\, 2026\nDec 8\, 2026
LOCATION:Malvern\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7e0bb28c7b29006f161ce2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
