 9/FGS_Banner_1-7-34.png
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Progra
 ms),Graduate Program in Financial Accountability
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Financ
 ial Accountability ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/6wmCtT2aR5KnUr
 Jwtr7kVQ )? We invite you to attend our program session. Registration is r
 equired ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/6wmCtT2aR5KnUrJwtr7kVQ ).
 \nYork’s Master of Financial Accountability (MFAc) is the only program o
 f its kind in the world. The MFAc is a way to accelerate your entry into s
 enior management\, assurance\, and oversight functions. Students are equip
 ped with the appropriate tools and knowledge required to deal innovatively
  with complex organizational\, ethical\, legislative\, and financial reali
 ties faced by organizations. You will acquire strong critical knowledge an
 d practical skills from across a broad range of areas\, from information t
 echnology to climate change. As a graduate of the program\, you will be in
  a position to assess and strengthen accountability and governance relatio
 nships in any public\, private\, or not-for-profit organization.\nTo learn
  more about other sessions being offered during our Experience Grad York w
 eek\, visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy.  ( http://Experience Grad York week\
 , visit yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy. )\nStill have questions? Contact us at f
 gsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( ht
 tps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/6wmCtT2aR5KnUrJwtr7kVQ ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Graduate Studies":MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/financial-accountability-mfac/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
