SUMMARY:Grad program in Environmental Studies (PHD)
DTSTART:20261013T130000Z
DTEND:20261013T140000Z
DTSTAMP:20260923T174200Z
UID:MEC-2281e4a23a72c3c35c20b9c18a6825d8@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261013T130000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Progra
 ms),Graduate Program in Environmental Studies
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260923
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in the Ph
 D in Environmental Studies ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/2dbCbp
 pjQ4Krmcz6TKYOZA )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nCreative
 ly redefine the boundaries of environmental research. Adopting an interdis
 ciplinary lens for your PhD in Environmental Studies\, you will create a u
 nique Program Plan\, to be guided by your supervisory committee. Using var
 ious conceptual approaches to explore environmental issues in their histor
 ical and comparative contexts\, you will analyze how theoretical and pract
 ical matters intersect\, and how reflexive\, rigorous\, critical and creat
 ive thinking can inform environmental research\, practice and policy. Expl
 ore conventional disciplines such as social sciences\, humanities\, arts a
 nd natural sciences in ways that encourage viewing issues through a broade
 r\, more contextual perspective\, with an emphasis on social justice.\nLea
 rn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/pr
 ograms  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have q
 uestions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\
 nRegistration Required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/2dbCbppjQ4
 Krmcz6TKYOZA ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Graduate Studies":MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/grad-program-in-environmental-studies-p
 hd/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-graduate-studies-virtual-open-house/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Experience Grad York – Graduate Studies Virtual Open House
DTSTART:20261013T130000Z
DTEND:20261016T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260922T013300Z
UID:MEC-78d7ed505d7e3ea21b2479fa7c1503d8@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261013T130000Z
SEQUENCE:4
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 01/fall_campus_13-scaled-e1769623726482.jpg
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260921
DESCRIPTION:Graduate Studies is where the next generation of careers and i
 deas are born. Come explore!\nThinking about your next chapter? Whether yo
 u’re exploring a career change or pursuing a new passion\, there’s no 
 better place to take that step than right here at York. The Faculty of Gra
 duate Studies (FGS) invites York alumni to Experience Grad York ( https://
 www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ )– a free\, multi-day online event from Tu
 esday October 13 – Friday October 16.\nWith sessions designed to guide y
 ou through every stage of graduate education\, this is your chance to see 
 how returning to York for a master’s or PhD can open new doors.\nHere ar
 e some of our popular EGY events:\nDean’s Session: Everything You Should
  Know About Grad School (That They Never Told You)\nGeneral Graduate Admis
 sions Drop In Hour – Virtual\nA Day in the Life of a Graduate Student\nH
 ow to Pay for Grad School: Funding\, Scholarships\, Bursaries\, OSAP\, and
  more\nI Didn’t Get In To Grad School at York (Or\, I’m Afraid I Won
 ’t). What Now?\nPlus – most graduate programs run an hour long program
  specific session! Find these sessions here.\nNote: This is a virtual even
 t\; all sessions will be via Zoom. Registration is required. ( https://www
 .yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ )\nQuestions? Reach out to our Graduate Recruit
 ment Team at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ( mailto:FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921
LOCATION:Online (Zoom)
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Graduate Studies":MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/experience-grad-york-graduate-studies-v
 irtual-open-house/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
