SUMMARY:Mystery Club “400 Days Later”
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T150000
UID:6aad5560ab7a8e0037c2bb16@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Maya has gone missing. With no new leads the case was closed a
 s a “Cold Case”. On the 400\nth\nday of her going missing a mysterious
  letter was hand delivered to her mother. This new evidence reopens the ca
 se. Join us in unraveling the mysteries and secrets surrounding Maya’s d
 isappearance. Help bring Maya home!\n*This program is completely fictional
  and created solely for entertainment purposes
LOCATION:Eglinton Square\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aad5560ab7a8e0037c2bb16
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
