SUMMARY:Gender\, Feminist & Women’s Studies (MA\, PhD)
DTSTART:20261013T143000Z
DTEND:20261014T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20260929T131400Z
UID:MEC-5a7acc9324aeef65925024a66800c015@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261013T143000Z
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 9/FGS_Banner_1-7-27.png
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Progra
 ms),Graduate Program in Gender, Feminist and Women's Studies
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Gender
 \, Feminist & Women’s Studies ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/g
 1Ru-AglQSCuSAkepl_Xhw )? We invite you to attend our program session. Regi
 stration is required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/g1Ru-AglQSCu
 SAkepl_Xhw )!\nThe Graduate Program in Gender\, Feminist and Women’s Stu
 dies offers an MA and a PhD to full-time and part-time students. Our Progr
 am is fundamentally interdisciplinary in formation and practice. One of ou
 r primary goals is to develop and apply a feminist analytical perspective 
 to teaching and research on women and gender as they intersect with sexual
 ity\, race\, ethnicity\, class\, ability\, and age. A second goal is to pr
 ovide rigorous interdisciplinary training that provides students with the 
 tools to enact social transformation in theory and praxis and enables stud
 ents to conduct research and analysis both within and outside academia.\nL
 earn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/
 programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have
  questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca )
 .\n
