DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Commun
 ication & Culture ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/A4PObbTXTzOm79U
 q-4Ju_w )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Joint Graduat
 e Program in Communication & Culture is a unique partnership of York Unive
 rsity and Toronto Metropolitan University. The Joint program combines acad
 emic and professional work\, with the objective of promoting the applicati
 on of critical theory and research to contemporary issues and practices in
  communication and culture. It brings together perspectives from the socia
 l sciences\, humanities and fine arts\, and communication—and media—re
 lated professions\, and aims to encourage critical and innovative thinking
 \, research\, and practice.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at fut
 urestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/g
 raduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.c
 a ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://yorku.zoo
 m.us/meeting/register/A4PObbTXTzOm79Uq-4Ju_w ).\n
