CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260902
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this Sparkshop with Marlene Bernholtz\, Associate 
 Professor in the Writing Department. This session will highlight how recip
 rocal\, considerate writing processes\, and clear supervisory communicatio
 n\, help graduate students meet academic and developmental goals.\n\nrefle
 ct on the challenges graduate students face when navigating the writing pr
 ocess\nreview and receive a copy of the Writing Centre Guide for Graduate 
 Student Support \nconsider challenges in the writing process that impact t
 he supervisory relationship\nidentify roles and key strategies graduate st
 udents can use to support their writing\n\nDate: Tuesday\, October 13\, 20
 26\nTime: 11:00AM to 11:30AM ET\nLocation: Online via Zoom\nRegistration i
 s required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/B1yKNj68RFO_vqrjgsmJiQ
  ) (click link)\n \nFor more information\, contact Tracy Bhoola\, Manager
 \, Graduate Supervision Support Hub tbhoola@yorku.ca\n
