DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Health
  ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/I-8YL6xJQfukmGEVcU1NaA )? We inv
 ite you to attend our program session!\nThe Graduate Program in Health is 
 an exciting learning environment that focuses on real-world and applied re
 search questions related to health. It is theoretically informed and resea
 rch-based. The program examines the effects of health policies\, health sy
 stems health care programs and practices\, norms\, organizations\, and dec
 ision-making on health outcomes that are often inequitable. The program em
 phasizes how societal\, economic\, political\, organizational\, and cultur
 al processes influence health. The program offers two fields of specializa
 tion: Health Policy & Equity and Health System Management & Health Data An
 alytics.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.c
 a/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\
 nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply
 @yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required. ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/regis
 ter/I-8YL6xJQfukmGEVcU1NaA )\n
