DESCRIPTION:Get ready for the autumn and Halloween season by creating your
  very own gel polish press-on nail set!\nAll supplies will be provided\, 
 including: an array of press-on nail sizes to choose from\, lots of gel p
 olish colours to use\, and fun Halloween nail art stickers.\nTeens will l
 eave with a mini nail prep goody bag with supplies and instructions for a
 pplication - allowing you to decide when you are ready to rock your new n
 ails \;)\nAll teens are welcome!\nRegistration required.\nSign up at TPL.c
 a\, ask at the reference desk or call our branch at 416-393-7610 to regist
 er by phone.\nLimit of 8 teens maximum\n– register soon!\nThis program i
 s part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens af
 ter school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. 
