 trategies to scale your brand\, navigate funding\, and optimize your launc
 h roadmap\n* Direct access to 200+ vetted industry leaders\, founders\, an
 d investors building in Canada\n* A look at what's next in consumer innova
 tion through a curated showcase of Canada's top emerging CPG brands\n\n
