UID:6a5ea6c89943bdf31ea05f1a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Wednesday afternoon at the library for a screening 
 of Shelter movie.\nOn a remote coastal island\, a reclusive man rescues a 
 young girl from a deadly storm\, drawing them both into danger. Forced out
  of isolation\, he must confront his turbulent past while protecting her\,
  sending them on a tense journey of survival and redemption.\nRated R. 1hr
  47 mins.\nEnglish Subtitles for the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (SDH) when a
 vailable.
