DESCRIPTION:This session ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_smrpp
 sUwTUiD2u2IfL1a8g ) will go over how to best prepare for graduate school a
 pplications when you still have a few years to go before formally applying
 . We’ll talk about application requirements and how you can start\, or c
 ontinue\, to meet and exceed them.\nThis session is meant for folks who ar
 e currently in their undergraduate program\, and plan on applying to gradu
 ate studies at least two years in the future if not more.\nYou are also we
 lcome to attend if you are no longer in an undergraduate program\, but sti
 ll do not plan on applying to graduate studies for at least two years in t
 he future if not more.\nIf you are interested in applying for a graduate p
 rogram starting in September 2026\, we invite you to check out any of the 
