DESCRIPTION:Computers for Beginners is a 6-week course designed to build y
 our confidence by introducing new skills slowly.\nIs This Course Right for
  You?\nFor beginners\, with\nvery\nlimited or\nno\ncomputer experience\nWh
 at Will You Learn?\nOctober 1\n: Use the Keyboard and Mouse\nOctober 8\n: 
 Use Google Search and Maps\nOctober 15\n: Word Basics 1 – Write a Simple
  letter and format a Flyer\nOctober 22\n: Excel Basics 1\nOctober 29\n: Pr
 actice and Review\nNovember 5\n: Practice and Review\nFormat: Hands-on wit
 h demonstrations\nWe provide the equipment or you can bring your own lapto
 p.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form 
