SUMMARY:Social Work (MSW\, PhD)
DTSTART:20261015T140000Z
DTEND:20261015T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260929T131400Z
UID:MEC-8698d181e9fe0f253656bcf4419ce43d@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261015T140000Z
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 9/FGS_Banner_1-7-23.png
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Progra
 ms),Graduate Program in Social Work
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Social
  Work ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/KrVOnpU7QVqURAhLeuTWqw )? W
 e invite you to attend our program session!\nYork’s MSW graduate program
  takes an approach to research and teaching that places diversity of exper
 ience (due to race\, class\, ability\, sexual orientation\, age\, gender i
 dentity and expression\, and religious/spiritual affiliation) as central t
 o understanding how oppression\, marginalization and assistance are constr
 ucted for persons in need of social work services. York University’s PhD
  in Social Work builds on the strengths and traditions of our undergraduat
 e and graduate programs\, while focusing on the conceptualization of the f
 ield of social work\, its antecedents\, theory and epistemology. Our progr
 am is distinguished by its critical approach to the field and its emphasis
  on human rights\, social justice and anti-oppression.\nLearn more about o
 ur graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/program ( http://
 futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/program )s\nStill have questions? Contact
  us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Req
 uired ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/KrVOnpU7QVqURAhLeuTWqw ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Graduate Studies":MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/social-work-msw-phd/
