DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Art Hi
 story & Visual Culture ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/a2aBdavhRo
 qDOygNdnK6nw )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Graduate
  Program in Art History & Visual Culture at York is a dynamic\, flexible a
 nd evolving course of study. Its global and interdisciplinary reach is fou
 nded on Canada’s diverse cultural history and heritage in the visual art
 s and is designed to meet current and future expectations of expertise in 
 art and architectural history\, visual culture\, critical theory and writi
 ng\, and the gallery and museum field. Responsive to individual student ne
 eds\, the program offers a range of courses\, placements\, visual and arch
 ival resources\, and faculty interests.\nLearn more about our graduate pro
 grams at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudent
 s.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsa
 pply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https
 ://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/a2aBdavhRoqDOygNdnK6nw ).\n
