SUMMARY:Human Resource Management (MHRM\, PhD)
DTSTART:20261015T160000Z
DTEND:20261015T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260929T131400Z
UID:MEC-ba368424b735e1761bc78ea814268bc3@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261015T160000Z
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 9/FGS_Banner_1-7-31.png
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Progra
 ms),Graduate Program in Human Resources Management
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Human 
 Resource Management ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/t4_b4qliRG2B9
 t0AKbjZlQ )? We invite you to attend our program information session!\nThe
  School of Human Resource Management is the largest university unit in Can
 ada devoted to the study of HRM\, making it a leader in its field. We offe
 r cutting-edge graduate programs that provide skilled professionals with t
 he competencies required to advance their careers. Students learn how to b
 ecome future leaders by discussing organizational behaviour\, industrial p
 sychology\, work law and labour policy. Our revered master’s and PhD pro
 grams have been voted best in Canada\, bringing home the Canadian HR Repor
 ter Reader’s Choice Awards for best education in the field. Students rec
 eive a high-caliber education while learning the best in professional prac
 tice from some of the most recognized experts in the field. Their wide-ran
 ging expertise include critical management studies\, gender and diversity\
 , human rights and many other areas.\nLearn more about our graduate progra
 ms at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.y
 orku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsappl
 y@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://
 yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/t4_b4qliRG2B9t0AKbjZlQ ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Graduate Studies":MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
