DESCRIPTION:Join us for a staff led tour of our current TD Gallery exhibit
 ion\,\nA Legacy in Motion: The National Ballet of Canada at 75\n!\nExplore
  75 years of The National Ballet of Canada through archival content from T
 oronto Public Library Special Collections and The National Ballet of Canad
 a Archives.\nFeaturing costume designs\, photography\, show worn costumes 
