UID:6a6cec3228fb9df67c51b6e0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto-based guitarist Karla García invites you on a musical
  journey from Baroque elegance to the soul of Latin America. The program f
 eatures works by Bach\, Barrios Mangoré\, Víctor Jara\, Atahualpa Yupanq
 ui\, Luiz Bonfá\, and Chilean composer Antonio Restucci\, alongside origi
 nal compositions from her upcoming debut album. This concert celebrates th
 e timeless voice of the classical guitar—intimate\, soulful\, and deeply
  human.
