 ng this session we’ll go over the details of each graduate credential of
 fered at York: master’s degrees\, PhD/doctoral degrees\, and graduate di
 plomas. We’ll discuss admission requirements\, program/degree requiremen
 ts\, and what to expect as a graduate student.\nLastly\, we’ll discuss h
 ow to go about choosing a graduate pathway to pursue.\nIf you have any acc
 essibility requirements for this event\, please let us know at fgsapply@yo
 rku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration is required. ( https://
