DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Inform
 ation Systems & Technology ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/sIAVzn
 _RTryS36Y-hFv2WQ )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe Mast
 er of Arts in Information Systems & Technology (MAIST) is an innovative gr
 aduate program dedicated to the study of Information Technologies and thei
 r application to solving business and societal problems. Working with facu
 lty experts from several departments at York University\, students can cho
 ose courses and research projects from many IT areas. A major feature of t
 he program is its flexibility and the option for students to choose course
 s from other programs that complement our IT courses. The program is desig
 ned for both working professionals and research-oriented students. Offered
  in both part-time and full-time format.\nLearn more about our graduate pr
 ograms at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestuden
 ts.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgs
 apply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( http
 s://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/sIAVzn_RTryS36Y-hFv2WQ ).\n
