DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Disast
 er & Emergency Management ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/HcFme67
 KS3-K4b6Q4f9HcA )? We invite you to attend our program information session
 !\nYork University offers leading graduate programs in Disaster & Emergenc
 y Management. Its Masters degree (MDEM) is the only such program offered i
 n Ontario\, and one of just two in Canada. It’s newly established PhD in
  Disaster & Emergency Management is the first such program in the entire c
 ountry. In this exciting and rapidly expanding field you will explore key 
 concepts\, methodologies and technologies used by emergency management pro
 fessionals while honing your analytical\, research and critical thinking s
 kills. Both the Master’s and Doctoral program are offered on a full-time
  or part-time basis\, and prepare you to synthesize large amounts of compl
 ex information and make sound decisions in challenging and often difficult
  circumstances.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.
 yorku.ca/graduate/program ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/progra
 m )s\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgs
 apply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/r
 egister/HcFme67KS3-K4b6Q4f9HcA ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Graduate Studies":MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
