DESCRIPTION:Interested in creating your own trading card game or board gam
 e but not sure how to turn your idea into reality? Join us for a hands on 
 program that goes over how to create your first prototype! Learn how you c
 an use library resources like printers\, Adobe software\, and more to deve
 lop your idea even further. This session will be a lecture with interactiv
 e elements and some hands components.\nChildren under 13 must be accompani
 ed by an adult.\nRegistration is required for this class and begins Octobe
 r 2nd\, 2026 at 12:30 pm.\nNote: Your spot will not be guaranteed after 5 
 minutes of the start of the program.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe 
 personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Libra
