 /Live-Tazhib-Lapiz-2024-Shirin-Divanbeigi10-Madalina-scaled-aspect-ratio-1
 600-1000-scaled.jpg?resize=1584%2C990&gravity
DESCRIPTION:Explore the intricacies of tazhib\, a traditional art form kno
 wn for its exquisite patterns and vibrant colours.\n\nThis workshop offers
  hands-on experience in tazhib techniques using gold paint and colours ins
 pired by the Museum’s collections. Join us to discover the beauty and hi
 story of tazhib in Islamic art. Gain new skills and insights as you unleas
 h your creativity in this enriching experience.
