UID:6ab68e7eda318a10e636b222@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Put your Toronto and democracy knowledge to the test at Lillia
 n H Smith's upcoming trivia program! Get competitive\, get social\, and ge
 t book prizes!\nThis program is meant for teens and young adults.  Registe
 r for a reminder. Drop-ins are welcome.\nToronto's municipal election take
 s place on October 26\, 2026. Check out the\nKnowYourVote.TO\nwebsite and 
 the\nCelebrate Democracy\npage to learn more about the upcoming election\,
  access important voter resources\, and discover activities and interactiv
 e library programs for all ages happening at a branch near you.\nThis init
 iative is made possible by donations to the Toronto Public Library Foundat
 ion and is generously supported by the McConnell Foundation.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Bagshaw
