SUMMARY:Tuesday Ravine Ride - Diagonal Lines-Kennedy to Distillery to Unio
 n Station
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261020T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261020T133000
UID:61fd71d4c815c483807df494840c186c@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:You MUST register in order to participate in this ride. This r
 ide will be open for registration for 6 days beginning on the Wednesday be
 fore the event. If you need to cancel your registration\, try to do so by 
 noon the day before the ride. If registration is full try the waitlist and
  check back regularly for possible cancellations. Remember: Have your tire
 s fully inflated\, wear your helmet and bring a spare inner tube for YOUR 
 bike. Description: A one-way route through Taylor Creek and the Don Valley
 . Enjoy the autumn colours. Coffee in the Distillery District where most o
 f the group usually ends the ride. However\, if you wish to return to Kenn
 edy station\, some of us continue to Union Station...
