DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is offering a virtual workshop
  to support Master’s students preparing applications for the upcoming Tr
 i-Council and Ontario Graduate Scholarship (OGS) competitions. This worksh
 op provides an overview of the application process and practical guidance 
 on preparing a strong research proposal for the Canada Graduate Research S
 cholarships (CGRS) competitions (Master’s\; SSHRC\, NSERC\, and CIHR)\, 
 as well as the Ontario Graduate Scholarship (OGS) competition at the maste
 r’s level. The session will conclude with a live Q&A\, giving participan
 ts the opportunity to ask questions about the application process and prop
 osal development.\nDate: Tuesday\, October 20\, 2026\nTime: 9:30-11:30 a.m
 .\nLocation: Online Zoom\nRegistration is required. ( https://yorku.zoom.u
 s/meeting/register/BbNltNFbTyKFVyywvaL0cw )\n
