CATEGORIES:Athletics &amp\; Recreation,Networking Opportunities (CCC),Spir
 it Day,Students,Workshops &amp\; Webinars (CCC)
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate York U Spirit Day by joining us for bracelet making 
 (breezeway) and lawn games! Connect with fellow students\, staff\, faculty
 \, and alumni while creating custom bracelets and enjoying friendly games.
