 ing? We invite you to join our virtual Graduate Nursing Information Sessio
 n to learn more about York University’s Graduate Nursing programs.\nOur 
 graduate program offers cutting-edge innovation grounded in foundational n
 ursing values—designed for nurses who want to become leaders\, educators
 \, and advanced nurse practitioners. The program integrates relational pri
 nciples with theoretical knowledge in areas such as transformational and o
 rganizational leadership\, caring and narrative pedagogies\, global and lo
 cal policy\, and human health experiences.\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Octobe
 r 20\, 2026\nTime: 2:00–3:00 p.m.\nLocation: Virtual (Zoom)\nJoin link
 : yorku.zoom.us/s/98348804418 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/s/98348804418 )\n\n
