 nder 13 must be accompanied by an adult.\nRegistration is required.\nRegis
 tration starts on October 6\, 2026 @ 12:30pm\nNote: Your spot will not be 
 guaranteed after 5 minutes of the start of the program.\nInformation Colle
 ction Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the T
 oronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20
