 ncepts and best practices\n***\nThis 2-hour program is held online via CRA
 's MS Teams. Please register to receive information on how to attend (an
  event reminder email will be sent approximately 24 hours before the ev
 ent begins).\nThis program will not be recorded. Captions will be availabl
 e.\n***\nAdditional CRA Info Sessions\nWe also offer an additional CRA Ta
 x Information Session for Small Corporations (T2) on\nThursday\, October 2
 2\, 2026 - 12:00 to 2:00 pm\n.\nLooking for a CRA info session for unincor
 porated small business owners and self-employed individuals (T1)? We also 
 offer them on:\nTuesday\, October 13\, 2026 - 6:30 to 8:30 pm\nThursday\, 
 October 15\, 2026 - 12:00 to 2:00 pm\nNeed help with MS Teams?\nJoining a
