UID:6a5a46060d65ac3600405e09@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the next meeting of the Danforth Book Club on Thu
 rsday\, October 22\, 2026!\nOver the summer (July to September)\, the Dan
 forth/Coxwell branch will be closed to the public to complete some essent
 ial renovations and upgrades. As of Saturday\, July 18\, 2026\, we be will
  closed for approximately 8 weeks.\nPlease check back for updates on our 
 re-opening date\, after which the October book\,\nDucks\n(also available a
 s the ebook\nDucks\n) will be available for pickup.\nIn the meantime\, wi
 shing you happy summer reading! See you in the fall!
LOCATION:Danforth/Coxwell\, Program Room\, 2nd Floor
