 : Excel Basics Part 1 or equivalent knowledge. Basic mouse and keyboard sk
 ills required.\nFormat:  Hands-on with demonstrations\n*Registration will 
 open two weeks before the class.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe pers
 onal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library u
