DESCRIPTION:Join fellow graduate students and Dr. Keith O’Regan\, Gradua
 te Specialist Writing Instructor\, with the Writing Centre\, in a supporti
 ve\, distraction-free virtual space dedicated to making steady progress on
  your writing. Following the Pomodoro Technique\, this weekly session is y
 our time to work on a thesis\, dissertation\, article\, or other academic 
 projects.\nRepeating weekly from October 2 – December 18\, 2026.\nRegist
