UID:6aad91f63dd190003e72f25d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come to our After Sc
 hool Club to learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids\, and have fu
 n! For\nages 6 to 8 years.\nFriday\, October 2nd\n-\nTree Candidate Button
  & Poster Making\n: Prepare buttons and flyers for the upcoming Tree Candi
 date Election 2026!\nFriday\, October 9th\n-\nDash/Sphero Coding\n: Learn 
 simple programming to move robots and accomplish a task\n.\nFriday\, Octob
 er 16th\n-\nPaper Frog\n: Make an easy paper frog and bring it home.\nFrid
 ay\, October 23rd\n-\nPlus-Plus\n: Plus-Plus is a fun\, simple creative to
 y that stimulates fine mother skills\, creativity\, focus and patience.\nF
 riday\, October 30th\n-\nAga Khan Museum Workshop\n: Aga Khan Museum will 
 present an arts and craft activity to celebrate Islamic Heritage Month.\n
 Snacks are offered during the After School Club for participants. Ingredie
 nt lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by
  donors.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this
  form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Librarie
 s Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be u
 sed for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Question
 s about how the library handles your information can be directed to Answer
 line staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Tor
 onto\, ON M4W 2G8.
