UID:6aab10b086d845003116ad98@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an opportuniy to handle\, examine up close and dis
 cuss nine real and replica fossils in this fascinating hands-on workshop. 
 Participants will be entertained and educated\, not just about the fossils
  themselves\, but the palaeontological aspects that underpin them. Concept
 s include: evolution\, fossilization\, ‘The Tree of Life’ (phylogeny) 
 and — of course — dinosaurs!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub servic
 e. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summ
 er\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks a
 re offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch 
