DESCRIPTION:We bring in a real civic innovator: an organizer\, technologis
 t\, or advocate to share their story and take your questions. Then they le
 ad a hands-on civic activity to get you thinking and collaborating. Every 
 Civic Spotlight is different because every guest brings something new.\nTh
 is program is part of TPL's Innovator in Residence series focused on civic
  innovation. From October 5 to November 28\, join programs\, workshops and
  one-on-one consultations led by technology strategist Ismail Mohamud to l
 earn how technology can help you create positive change in your community.
  Learn more at\ntpl.ca/iir\n.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe persona
 l information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library unde
 r the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The infor
 mation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and
