DESCRIPTION:🎃 Bloor West Village Halloween Fest returns this October! 👻\n🗓️ Mark your calendars for a FREE Family event happening on:\nSat\, October 24 | 11 AM – 3 PM\nCheck In: St. Olave’s Church (on Windermere)\, with activities taking place along Bloor St W. \nVillage-Wide FREE Family Activities:\n🍬 Trick-or-Treat* Trail with businesses | 11 AM – 1 PM\n🔎 Village-Wide Scavenger Hunt & chance to WIN prizes\n🧛 Costumed Characters\, Games\, Music & Crafts\n🎃 Pumpkin Giveaway* & Professional Photo on a Fall Backdrop\n☕ Seasonal Food & Drink Specials\n🛍️ Shopping Promotions & In-Store Experiences\n🚶 NEW: Guided Fall Leaves Walking Tour | 9 AM – 11 AM \n(*while supplies last) \n🔴 Note – Trick or Treating will happen only for 2 hours from 11 AM – 1 PM\, while other activities will take place until 3 PM. 🔴 \nStay tuned for more details!
