DESCRIPTION:Learn scratch coding and create a  game. We’ll explore the f
 undamentals of block coding while completing a basic project. No prior kno
 wledge of coding or scratch interface is required to attend.\nTo save proj
 ect a scratch account must be made prior to the class. (\nhttps://scratch.
 mit.edu/\n). Parents must be able to log their child into the scratch acco
 unt. Scratch account is NOT mandatory to participate.\nAll materials will 
