DESCRIPTION:FREE for Academy of Fun and Games! \n\n Participants of this w
 orkshop will learn some basic principles of narrative game design and gain
  hands-on experience in creating their own work using Texture Writer. Text
 ure was co-designed in Toronto and Finland and since its release\, thousan
 ds of users have created stories generating two million combined plays. Fo
 r its tenth birthday it's being released as an open source project.\n\n Ch
 eck out Texture Writer Here! \n\n \n \n \n Schedule : \n \n \n Workshop\, 
 Sunday October 25\,  1pm - 4pm (3 hours) \n \n \n \n \n \n \n Outcomes : 
 \n \n \n This is a very hands-on workshop: \n \n \n- \n Learn narrative pr
 inciples \n\n- \n Get to know Texture Writer \n\n- \n Learn about Open-Sou
 rce \n\n- \n \n Meet the Developers \n \n\n \n Please note: Workshops need
  to start on time - any no-shows will be given away to anyone in attendanc
 e. \n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n Want to get notified next time classes are posted
 ? \n\n Join our mailing list!
LOCATION:TTLMakerspace\, 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://ttlmarket.com/products/texture-writer-workshop-oct-25
X-SOURCE:Toronto Tool Library
END:VEVENT
