UID:6aac2109a5dbde002aa548f6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Make your very own edible slime! Tap into your five senses\, g
 et creative\, and learn about mindfulness while crafting a delicious treat
  that you can take home! All ingredients and equipment to be provided.​\
 nFood allergy notice\n: Please be aware that food will be used in this pro
 gram. Food products used in this program may contain or may have come into
  contact with common allergens. (*Contains dairy\, sugar\, and caffeine)\n
