DESCRIPTION:Calling all children ages 9 to 12 and their mother\, father\, 
 grandmother\, grandfather\, or caregiver! Join our monthly family book clu
 b. One child 9 to 12\, one parent/caregiver\, one book per month.\nLast Mo
 nday of every month\, unless noted otherwise.\nRegistration is required. P
 lease register ONCE for your pair (child and caregiver).\nInformation Coll
 ection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the 
 Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 2
 0(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program 
