SUMMARY:Senior’s Social: Arabic Calligraphy for Seniors
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T150000
UID:6abea22ede300e0045177682@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Islamic History and Culture!\nDiscover and learn the
  basics about the art of Arabic Calligraphy.  An overview of the details o
 f writing Arabic calligraphy will be provided then participants will be in
 troduced to the basic strokes and guided to making an end piece to take ho
 me.\nGain cultural appreciation for the 1400 year old traditional skill of
  Arabic writing during this relaxing and stress-free activity while improv
 ing fine motor skills\, hand-eye coordination and patience.\nLight refresh
 ments will be provided.\nRegistration required\nArabic Calligraphy\nLearn 
 World Calligraphy\nThe History and Achievements of the Islamic Golden Age
LOCATION:Morningside
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abea22ede300e0045177682
