BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/recovery-college-week-4-algorithms-ai-literacy-supporting-your-digital-footprint/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Recovery College: YU & Balance Week 4 | Algorithms & AI literacy: 
 Supporting your digital footprint
DTSTART:20261027T160000Z
DTEND:20261027T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260901T132600Z
UID:MEC-8c7c866a13f952e17395811408d2fd1b@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261027T160000Z
SEQUENCE:4
CATEGORIES:Athletics &amp\; Recreation,Bethune College,Calumet College,Col
 leges,Divisions and Special Areas,Faculties,Faculty of Health,Faculty of L
 iberal Arts &amp\; Professional Studies,Faculty of Science,Glendon,Health 
 Education &amp\; Promotion,LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&amp\;PS Community Hub,LA
 &amp\;PS Founders College,LA&amp\;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp\;PS New Col
 lege,LA&amp\;PS Vanier College,Lassonde School of Engineering,Learning Com
 mons,Learning Skills Services,School of Continuing Studies,Stong College,S
 tudent Counselling, Health &amp\; Well-being,Students,Well-being
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260901
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever googled yourself? Or maybe an old friend from hi
 gh school? Once something is shared online\, it becomes easily findable wi
 th just one search.\nIn this week’s session of YU & Balance\, participan
 ts will:\n\nGet a better grasp on what digital footprint is\nHow to find r
 eliable sources of information\nUnderstand algorithms\, social media feeds
  and strategize on how to mindfully engage AI\n\nThis session is part of a
  6-week Recovery College series. For each session attended\, participants 
 will receive $5 on their YU-card. To receive the gift card\, you must atte
 nd the full session (approximately 45–60 minutes). Unfortunately\, we’
 re not able to provide gift cards for partial attendance. Gift cards will 
 be emailed after the session to the same email address used to register an
 d join the session.\nSpace is limited\, and registration is offered on a f
 irst-come\, first-served basis. If the session is full and you’d like to
  be added to the waitlist\, please email hstacey@yorku.ca ( mailto:hstacey
 @yorku.ca ). We’ll reach out if a spot becomes available. If you’re re
 gistered but can no longer attend\, please let us know as soon as you can 
 so we can offer your spot to another student.\nRegister for Algorithms & A
 I Literacy – Supporting Your Digital Footprint ( https://yorku.zoom.us/m
 eeting/register/M3uQx0eqTJGCmC5xrqHvZw )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001
LOCATION:Online (Zoom)
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/recovery-college-week-4-algorithms-ai-l
 iteracy-supporting-your-digital-footprint/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
