SUMMARY:LA&PS Get Spooky
DTSTART:20261027T160000Z
DTEND:20261027T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260804T201100Z
UID:MEC-68d42d85d6ef70aa12305106ba6abc20@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261027T160000Z
SEQUENCE:5
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/0
 9/LAPS-Get-Spooky-1_Erica-Alusio.png
CATEGORIES:LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&amp\;PS Department of Anthropology,LA&am
 p\;PS Department of Communication &amp\; Media Studies,LA&amp\;PS Departme
 nt of Economics,LA&amp\;PS Department of English,LA&amp\;PS Department of 
 Equity Studies,LA&amp\;PS Department of French Studies,LA&amp\;PS Departme
 nt of History,LA&amp\;PS Department of Humanities,LA&amp\;PS Department of
  Languages, Literatures &amp\; Linguistics,LA&amp\;PS Department of Philos
 ophy,LA&amp\;PS Department of Politics,LA&amp\;PS Department of Social Sci
 ence,LA&amp\;PS Department of Sociology,LA&amp\;PS Founders College,LA&amp
 \;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp\;PS New College,LA&amp\;PS School of Admini
 strative Studies,LA&amp\;PS School of Gender, Sexuality and Women's Studie
 s,LA&amp\;PS School of Human Resources Management,LA&amp\;PS School of Inf
 ormation Technology,LA&amp\;PS School of Public Policy &amp\; Administrati
 on,LA&amp\;PS School of Social Work,LA&amp\;PS SCOLAPS,LA&amp\;PS SNACK,LA
 &amp\;PS Student Success,LA&amp\;PS Students-Undergrad,LA&amp\;PS Vanier C
 ollege
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260804
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to take a break\, get into the Halloween
  spirit\, and meet new friends? Join us for Let’s Get Spooky! 🎃\nDesi
 gned especially for first-year LA&PS students\, this festive drop-in event
  is the perfect place to connect with classmates\, unwind from your studie
 s\, and enjoy an afternoon of spooky fun. Put your problem-solving skills 
 to the test in our Halloween-themed escape room\, explore interactive game
 s and challenges\, get creative with hands-on crafts\, strike a pose at ou
 r photo booth\, and take part in a scavenger hunt full of surprises. You
 ’ll also find board games\, cozy Halloween vibes\, and plenty of opportu
 nities to relax and socialize.\nAnd of course\, no Halloween celebration w
 ould be complete without free pizza\, treats\, and festive snacks!\nWhethe
 r you stay for the whole event or just stop by between classes\, there’s
  something for everyone. Come dressed in your Halloween spirit\, bring you
 r friends\, and make some new ones along the way.\nWe can’t wait to cele
 brate with you! 👻🍬\nRegister Now\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804
LOCATION:152 Founders Assembly Hall\, Founders College
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laps-get-spooky-612-686/
