DESCRIPTION:Victor and Victoria's families have arranged their marriage. T
 hough they like each other\, Victor is nervous about the ceremony. While h
 e's in a forest practicing his lines for the wedding\, a tree branch becom
 es a hand that drags him to the land of the dead. It belongs to Emily\, wh
 o was murdered after eloping with her love and wants to marry Victor. Vict
 or must get back aboveground before Victoria marries the villainous Barkis
  Bittern.\nRuntime 1 hour\, 17 minutes.\nDrop-in until space is full.
LOCATION:Parkdale\, Meeting room A
