SUMMARY:Scholars’ Hub | Reclaim Your Commute: Find balance and well-bein
 g on the way 
DTSTART:20261028T160000Z
DTEND:20261028T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260928T195900Z
UID:MEC-aa37b70bbe5a37d659bf67dee2ca9492@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261028T160000Z
SEQUENCE:1
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 9/scholarsHub_CRMbanner_2026update__1_.png
CATEGORIES:Advancement/Alumni
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260928
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Winny Shen\, Associate Professor of Organization Stud
 ies\, Schulich School of Business\nYour commute could be more than just ge
 tting from point A to point B. In this session\, we’ll explore how commu
 ting can be transformed from a daily drain into a valuable part of your da
 y—whether as a time to decompress\, prepare for what’s ahead\, or simp
 ly enjoy a few moments to yourself. You’ll learn practical\, research-ba
 cked ways to make your commute more enjoyable and support your overall wel
 l-being.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928
ORGANIZER;CN="Alumni Engagement":MAILTO:alumnievents@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/scholars-hub-reclaim-your-commute-find-
 balance-and-well-being-on-the-way/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
