X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/from-vision-to-action-mobilizing-unions-workers-and-students-for-a-radically-just-transition/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:From Vision to Action: Mobilizing Unions\, Workers and Students Fo
 r a Radically-Just Transition
DTSTART:20261028T163000Z
DTEND:20261028T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20261002T145100Z
UID:MEC-aff00d3a27b58d7e744930ba3a082559@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261028T163000Z
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 9/Garance-Malivel_YFile-Banner.png
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Environmental &amp\; Urban Change,Research &amp\; In
 novation,YFile newsletter
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261002
DESCRIPTION:With: Garance Malivel\, Education Sector Coordinator at Worker
 s for Climate Justice / Travailleuses et travailleurs pour la justice clim
 atique (TJC)  \nDrawing on the work of Montreal-based TJC\, this worksho
 p will explore how popular education\, participatory research\, and collec
 tive organizing can strengthen democratic power in the workplace. It will 
 highlight Transformations en cours\, a pilot campaign led with teachers’
  unions and student associations to develop a shared vision and strategy f
 or transforming Quebec’s higher education system.   \n[RSVP here] \n
 This event is part of the 2026-2027 series Up in Flames: Anticolonial Impu
 lses for a Radically-Just Transition\, a collaboration between the Global 
 Labour Research Centre (GLRC) ( https://www.yorku.ca/research/glrc/ )\, In
 frastructure Beyond Extractivism (IBE) and Trade Unions and Labour Environ
 mentalism Network (TULE).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002
LOCATION:140 HNES Building
ORGANIZER;CN="Global Labour Research Centre":MAILTO:glrc@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/from-vision-to-action-mobilizing-unions
 -workers-and-students-for-a-radically-just-transition/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
