DESCRIPTION:Enjoy the spookiest season of all by joining us for a movie ni
 ght. We will hold an evening screening of\nCrimson Peak\n.\nTitle:\nCrimso
 n Peak\n(2016)\nRunning time:\n119 minutes\nDirector: Guillermo Del Toro\n
 Starring:\nMia Wasikowska\, Tom Hiddleston\, Jessica Chastain\, Charlie Hu
 nnam\nSynopsis: In the aftermath of a family tragedy\, an aspiring author
  is torn between love for her childhood friend and the temptation of a mys
 terious outsider. Trying to escape the ghosts of her past\, she is swept a
 way to a house that breathes\, bleeds...and remembers.\nPlease note this m
 ovie is rated\n14A\nas per the Ontario Film Review Board.\nRegistration i
 s not required. Drop-in until capacity is reached.
