SUMMARY:YU Speak: Where Ideas Take Shape
DTSTART:20261029T140000Z
DTEND:20261029T153000Z
DTSTAMP:20260810T131600Z
UID:MEC-95a976f4986cace28bc02aa631f7b88f@events.yorku.ca__20261029
