ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 8/Events-Calendar-Image-3.png
CATEGORIES:Academic Advising &amp\; Student Success,Markham Campus
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260810
DESCRIPTION:Nervous about presentations or public speaking?\nYU Speak is a
  supportive\, hands-on workshop series designed to help you build confiden
 ce\, strengthen your communication skills\, and become a more effective pr
 esenter. Through interactive activities\, peer feedback\, and guided pract
 ice\, you’ll learn how to:\n\nUnderstand your audience and craft clear\,
  engaging messages\nStructure presentations and tell compelling stories\nD
 esign effective slides and visual aids\nImprove delivery\, body language\,
  and presentation presence\nNavigate group and online presentations with c
 onfidence\n\nWhether you’re preparing for class presentations\, competit
 ions\, interviews\, or future career opportunities\, YU Speak provides a l
 ow-stakes environment to practice and grow. Students can also earn certifi
 cates and participation badges by completing workshop milestones. \n\nLoc
 ation: Markham Campus\, Room 2050\nFormat: 6-week series (5 workshops + 1 
 culminating presentation event)\nDuration: Every Thursdays from 10:00am 
 – 11:30am\nDates:\n\nSeptember 24th\nOctober 1st\nOctober 8th\, no sessi
 on during Reading Week\nOctober 22nd\nOctober 29th\nNovember 5th\n\nRegist
 ration Link: YU Speak: Where Ideas Take Shape (Fall 2026) – Fill out fo
 rm ( https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/KUSWKDCbtg )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260810
LOCATION:Markham Campus (MK2050)
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/yu-speak-where-ideas-take-shape/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
