DESCRIPTION:In this program led by spoken word coach Joshua Watkis\, parti
 cipants will learn the\nhistory and mechanics of Rhythm and Poetry (Rap)\,
  practice basic rhyme schemes\nand literary devices\, and write and share 
 their own 8-16 bar verse\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth
  Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, whe
