DESCRIPTION:Join us for a screening of\nA Haunting in Venice\n(2023)\n“N
 ow retired and living in self-imposed exile in the world's most glamorous 
 city\, Poirot reluctantly attends a séance at a decaying\, haunted palazz
 o. When one of the guests is murdered\, the detective is thrust into a sin
 ister world of shadows and secrets.”\n103 mins (1.5 hrs)\nPG – Mild vi
 olence\, disturbing images\nThis film will be screened with English closed
 -captions (CC) enabled.
