DESCRIPTION:Drop-in on the last Thursday of the month for a lively book di
 scussion led by a librarian!\nRegular Print copies of October's selection\
 ,\nPrairie Edge\nby Conor Kerr\, will be available to pick up from the fir
 st floor reference desk beginning on September 24\, 2026.\nThis title is a
 lso available as an eBook\, and as an eAudiobook.\nUpcoming Titles:\nSepte
 mber 24 - All's Well by Mona Awad\nOctober 29 - Prairie Edge by Conor Ker
 r\nNovember 26 - The Lion Women of Tehran by Marjan Kamali\nJanuary 28 - T
 o Be Announced\nFebruary 25 - Encampment by Maggie Helwig\nMarch 25 - The 
 Tainted Cup by Robert Jackson Bennett
