SUMMARY:Drawing & Painting Geometric Patterns: The Symbolism and Complexit
 y of Islamic Patterns
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T200000
UID:6aa9a4f3f9ed2e003850e490@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, learn the symbolism and complexity behind I
 slamic patterns and experiment with the technique of using 7 overlapping c
 ircles to create designs. Choose a colour scheme inspired by Islamic patte
 rns found in architecture\, ceramics and textiles and guided in colour mix
 ing to create a design. By the end of the workshop each participant will h
 ave a hand-drawn and painted original geometric pattern.
LOCATION:Malvern
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9a4f3f9ed2e003850e490
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
