SUMMARY:FRC Toronto :: Saturday Run
DESCRIPTION:Founders Running Club :: Toronto\n**Founders Running Club** (F
 RC) brings founders\, investors\, tech\, creative people and startup enthu
 siasts together for weekly easy runs and networking. We like to be comfort
 able when we run and finish with coffee and conversations. Choose your pac
 e or follow a pacer—pets\, friends\, family\, are welcome.\n\n🗓️ La
 unched in San Francisco\, July 16\, 2022\n🌍 Now in 35+ cities\n📅 Run
