UID:6a8f1240b20478002995acff@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn to make barrel weave chainmaille bracelets with jeweller
 y craftsperson Laurie Poirier! Make your own bracelet to take home with yo
 u and Laurie will explain how to purchase more materials to make more chai
