SUMMARY:Silent Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T200000
UID:6a7ce66f2c859e0086ae7144@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the first Tuesday of the month for Silent Book Club
 . Bring your own book\, or choose something from our collection\, and spen
 d some time silently reading together. Afterwards\, we'll all discuss what
  we were reading together! Drop in\, no registration required!
LOCATION:Highland Creek
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7ce66f2c859e0086ae7144
