 cure portal that allows you to view your personal income tax and benefit i
 nformation and manage your tax affairs online. Learn how to register for a
 nd use My Account to track your refund\, view benefit and credit payments\
 , update personal information\, set up direct deposit\, receive online mai
 l\, and access a variety of CRA services.\nPresented as part of Financial 
 Literacy Month.\nRegistration:\nThis virtual event is free to join and wil
 l take place on\nZoom\n.\nRegister to receive an email with details on how
  to join the session. Join live\, as there will not be a recording for th
 is event.\nCaptions will be available.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-\nJoining a
 nd participating in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\nInformation
