DESCRIPTION:Create a beautiful ocean-inspired pearl diamond art piece feat
 uring flowing waves and shimmering pearls. This calming activity encourage
 s creativity\, relaxation\, and self-expression while creating a stunning 
 piece of art to enjoy or display in your home.\nAll materials will be prov
 ided. Please note that space is limited. Arrive early to ensure your spot.
 \nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming pl
 ace for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are alw
 ays available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a bra
 nch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium\, lower level of the Don Mills branch.
