 , route and other information will be determined after the City Walk Plann
 ing Meeting (in August\, September\, or October). We will meet at about 10
 :00 AM at a location to be determined\, and the walk will begin at 10:10. 
 We have introduced a 30-Day-Trial membership class which allows "guests" t
 o participate in most activities over the span of a 1-month period. We are
