DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T113000
UID:6ab7053e31e9a41a0fbc947c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for creative group activities that support mental well
 ness\, social connection and a sense of belonging. Enjoy music\, movement\
 , mindfulness and more while connecting with others and engaging with your
  community.\nDrop-in\, no registration is required.\nTTC Presto tickets wi
 ll be provided upon request.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all
  participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.\nThis 
 program is in collaboration with\nCanadian Mental Health Association Toron
 to\n.
