UID:6a9adcef29a7dd0d674905e1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This interactive workshop explores two career options–employ
 ment and entrepreneurship. Participants will examine the opportunities\, 
 benefits\, and challenges of each pathway while reflecting on their own g
 oals\, strengths\, and aspirations.\nThe session introduces the concept o
 f an entrepreneurial mindset and explores how entrepreneurship can take m
 any different forms. Participants will also explore common challenges and
  fears associated with both employment and entrepreneurship\, helping the
 m gain greater clarity and confidence as they consider their next career 
 step.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this fo
 rm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries A
 ct\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used
