DESCRIPTION:​It is very likely that someone will encounter their first i
 nterview experience in their youth\, yet the skills required to complete a
  successful interview are often unpracticed and unknown to them. This prog
 ram will introduce skills such as speaking professionally\, what kind of q
 uestions to expect\, interview processes\, preparation and learning to exu
 de genuine confidence.  Increase your potential for success by learning th
 ese integral skills to acing an interview!  Presented by Victoria Tung.\
