DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T153000
UID:6aac4984101eb7003f30f1ac@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon of art! Using watercolour pencils\, p
 aper\, and water\, trace and paint a beautiful design\, or draw your own i
 mage. All materials will be provided.\nPlease note\n: These programs fill 
 up very quickly\, and there's almost always a waitlist. If you're unable t
 o make the program\, please cancel your registration as early as possible\
