DESCRIPTION:Peer-Assisted Study Session (PASS) Leader: Amir\nThis Peer-ass
 isted Study Session (PASS) is for CSSD 1101 Coding through Biology (CS1 A)
  and CSSD 1102 Coding through Chemistry (CS1 B)\, Fall 2026.\nParticipate 
 in weekly\, collaborative study sessions led by a peer who has successfull
 y completed the course. Review key concepts\, ask questions and discover e
 ffective strategies to boost your confidence and academic success.\nPlease
  Note: Any schedule changes or session cancellations will be communicated 
 through eClass. Students are encouraged to check eClass regularly for the 
 most up-to-date information. During Fall Reading Week\, Peer-Assisted Stud
 y Sessions\, Tutoring\, and Office Hours are typically not offered. If a s
 ession is scheduled during this period\, details will be communicated by t
 he course instructor and posted in eClass.\nLearn more about PASS ( https:
 //students.yorku.ca/PASS ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001
LOCATION:MK 2040\, Markham Campus
ORGANIZER;CN="Markham Campus Peer-Assisted Study Sessions":MAILTO:
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://students.yorku.ca/PASS
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
