 ebinar/register/WN_WaRkwRrIQ-67m1zlD-GcUw ).\nLearn more about our graduat
 e programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurest
 udents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nFor any questions\, please email us a
 t FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA.\n
