DESCRIPTION:Join fellow like-minded writers in creative environment! We wi
 ll spend the first 20-30 minutes writing based on a prompt of the libraria
 n's choosing. Afterwards\, writers are invited to share what they've writt
 en or just join in for friendly discussion. All styles\, genres\, and leve
 ls are welcome.
LOCATION:Deer Park\, Room 204
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a87027693b500003ff632d1
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
