DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned maker or just getting started\, come
  join our Crafting Circle for a friendly hour and a half of textile and f
 ibre arts. Bring your own knitting\, crochet\, embroidery\, sewing\, mendi
 ng\, or other creative projects\, along with your curiosity and conversati
 on. Enjoy crafting alongside fellow enthusiasts in a welcoming\, informal 
 environment. All skill levels welcome.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Bagshaw room
