 lude:\nOMVIC’s Compensation Fund\nUnderstanding Car Dealer Advertising\n
 Negative Equity & Long Term Loans\nAgreement & Disclosure\nAvoiding Curbsi
 des & Fraud Prevention\nTips for Buying or Leasing a Car\nRegistration:\nT
 his virtual Zoom event is free to join. Once registered\, you’ll receive
