 and are interested in displaying during the community showcase. The Innova
 tor In Residence will be in attendance to assist and offer advice.\nThis p
 rogram is part of TPL's Innovator in Residence series focused on civic inn
 ovation. From October 5 to November 28\, join programs\, workshops and one
