 6ce68f57cb/6aad9f92ca995fa8efe2f0f2/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Jennifer Shahade on strategy\, power and seeing the 
 board differently. Chess master Jennifer Shahade\, author of Thinking Sid
 eways and Chess Queens\, joins...
LOCATION:Soulpepper Theatre\,50 Tank House Lane\, Toronto\, ON M5A 3C4\, 
 Canada
CREATED:20260918T203118Z
DTSTAMP:20261003T050433Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260918T203118Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
