UID:6aa00d032dac6e003724c386@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Digest This!\nis a hands-on workshop where participants explor
 e how organic waste can be transformed into renewable energy. Through fun 
 experiments\, you will discover chemical changes\, explore temperature and
  gas production\, and learn basic science and lab techniques.\nThis progra
 m is for Tween Hour ages 11-17 years old. Drop in\, space is limited\, fir
 st come first serve.
LOCATION:Humberwood
