DESCRIPTION:Join us for a documentary film screening and panel discussion 
 to commemorate National Housing Day in partnership with Homeless Connect T
 oronto and supported by National Film Board of Canada.\nThe short films by
  filmmaker Nadine Valcin are "Co-Ops & The Power of Community" and "Commun
 al Land for the Common Good." The films highlight the impact co-ops have o
 n the Toronto community\, as well as the spectrum of housing options avail
 able and being formed from the grassroots level. A panel discussion\, feat
 uring local affordable housing experts\, follows the screening.\nDoors ope
 n: 6pm
