 ine Brooks\nMar. 25.\nThe Marriage Portrait\nby Maggie O'Farrell\nApr. 22.
 \nThe Adversary\nby Michael Crummey\nMay 27.\nAuthor Talk\nwith\nCathy Mar
 ie Buchanan\nJun. 24.\nJames\nby Percival Everett\nSummer Break for July &
  August\nSept. 23.\nThe Years\nby Annie Ernaux\nOct. 28.\nGilead\nby Maril
 ynne Robinson\nNov. 25.\nRage the Night\nby Donna Morrissey\nDec. 09.\nLoo
 k at the Lights\, My Love\nby Annie Ernaux\nInformation Collection Notice:
