SUMMARY:Making the Most of your Budget and Benefits
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T193000
UID:6aac69aa101eb7003f30fec3@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Feeling like your money doesn’t go far as it used to? You’
 re not alone. Presented by financial empowerment staff from WoodGreen Comm
 unity Services\, this session will explore practical ways to manage your b
 udget\, reduce expenses\, and make the most of available benefits and prog
 rams. We’ll share simple strategies to help you stay on top of spending\
 , stretch your dollars further\, and plan ahead.\nAfter the session\, stay
  to chat with Financial Empowerment (FE) staff from WoodGreen Community Se
 rvices for a\nbrief one-on-one support\n.\nDrop-in welcome!\nNo registrati
 on required. Snacks and refreshments are provided for all participants. In
 gredient lists will be available at the program.
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Program room 1
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aac69aa101eb7003f30fec3
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
