UID:6ab687b3a5dbde002aa71e02@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a screening of\nRichard Jewell\n(2019)\n“Based o
 n the true story of Richard Jewell\, the security guard whose swift action
 s saved countless lives during the 1996 Atlanta bombing\, and the chaos hi
 s life was thrown into as the media and FBI alike targeted the naïve hero
  as the terrorist act’s number one suspect.”\n129 mins (2 hrs)\nPG –
  Strong language\, mature themes\, violent imagery\nThis film will be scre
 ened with English closed-captions (CC) enabled.
LOCATION:Brentwood\, 1st floor\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab687b3a5dbde002aa71e02
