UID:6a9b3c763b6c71003e5de19d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a creative afternoon of poetry writing and di
 scussion. Share your words in a supportive atmosphere\, respond to the poe
 ms of others\, receive writing tips\, and explore the works of a wide rang
