DESCRIPTION:A closing session for all participants to reflect on what they
  built and learned\, celebrate their work\, and leave with resources and p
 athways to continue their civic tech journey beyond the residency.\nThis p
 rogram is part of TPL's Innovator in Residence series focused on civic inn
 ovation. From October 5 to November 28\, join programs\, workshops and one
 -on-one consultations led by technology strategist Ismail Mohamud to learn
  how technology can help you create positive change in your community. Lea
 rn more at\ntpl.ca/iir\n.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal in
 formation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under th
