UID:6ab7fe0d001a4a0e055c3565@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Morningside library's Tween/Teen Book Club! Come join us every
  other month to discuss an exciting book in a fun & friendly atmosphere! 
 Light refreshments will be available.\n*NEW*\nNow including\ntweens!\nAll 
 youth\, teens\, & tweens (ages 10+) are welcome :)\nThe next Tween/Teen B
 ook Club will take place on SAT NOV 28 (2-3pm) for\nA Wrinkle in Time\nby
  Madeleine L'Engle.\nIn October\, copies of the new book will be available
  to borrow at Morningside branch - feel free to come by & borrow a copy a
 t your convenience - or place a hold on your own copy at any time!\n______
 ___________\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on t
 his form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libra
 ries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only b
 e used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Quest
 ions about how the library handles your information can be directed to Ans
 werline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, 
 Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Morningside\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab7fe0d001a4a0e055c3565
