DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261129T150000
UID:6a5299330e562e280099311d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:LEGO Free Play is a fun\, creative program where children can 
 build anything they imagine using LEGO bricks. There are no instructions o
 r rules to follow\, kids are free to explore\, create\, and play at their 
 own pace. This open-ended play encourages creativity\, problem-solving\, a
 nd social interaction.\nDrop-in program\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Mount Pleasant\, Second floor- children's section
