 s that can truly make a podcast shine. We’ll cover the importance of cho
 osing a format\, creating a compelling script and how to engage listeners 
 through a strong call to action. If you are thinking about starting a podc
 ast\, or are interested in taking your show to the next level\, this is fo
 r you.\nAmanda Cupido is author of\nLet's Talk Podcasting\n.\nDrop-in is f
 ine\, however\, please register so we can estimate audience size and you 
 can also receive a reminder email before the event.\nInformation Collectio
 n Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toron
 to Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\
 , and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program regis
 tration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles
  your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.c
 a\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
