DESCRIPTION:Join us at the library for a fun hour of stem related activiti
 es. Come out to build\, create and code with Snap Circuits\, Dash and Dot\
 , Scratch Coding\, LEGO\, Magnetic Tiles and more!\nThe club is intended f
 or children aged 6 to 12 years.\nDue to the limited number of robots\, pa
 rticipants may be asked to share with other participants.\nDrop-in. No reg
 istration is required.
LOCATION:Parliament Street\, Main Floor Program Room
