SUMMARY:Grown-ups Reading Children's Literature Book Club: The BFG by Roal
 d Dahl
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261205T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261205T160000
UID:6a7bb98e3b6c71003e584374@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the monthly meeting of Osborne Collection Grown-up
 s Reading Children's Literature Book Club. It is for adult readers who enj
 oy children's books. Revisit favourite stories of your childhood or read m
 ore or less known notable books for young readers for the first time.\nWe 
 meet once a month on the first or second Saturday (2.30-4PM). Drop in prog
 ram\, no registration.\nDecember 5: The BFG by Roald Dahl\nJanuary 9 (2027
 ): Number the Stars by Lois Lowry\nThe BFG
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Osborne Collection\, \n4th floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7bb98e3b6c71003e584374
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
