SUMMARY:Exhibition Tour - A Legacy in Motion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261208T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261208T153000
UID:6ab5188d8cf597003f961b89@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a staff led tour of our current TD Gallery exhibit
 ion\,\nA Legacy in Motion: The National Ballet of Canada at 75\n!\nExplore
  75 years of The National Ballet of Canada through archival content from T
 oronto Public Library Special Collections and The National Ballet of Canad
 a Archives.\nFeaturing costume designs\, photography\, show worn costumes 
 and more!\nRegistration is not required but encouraged.\nInformation Colle
 ction Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the T
 oronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20
