DESCRIPTION:Present and past TPL’s EIRs\, their respective participants\
 , and TPL staff are all invited to meet up and share their entrepreneuria
 l stories and resources. Join this session\, hosted by Entrepreneur in Res
 idence (Newcomer Focus)\, Jean Chow\, to expand your personal network th
 rough the TPL Small Business community and share your suggestions on ways
  to make TPL’s Small Business Programs and Services serve you better!\nI
 n this session:\nCreate a strong small business community with members who
  are motivated to help and support one another on a regular basis.\nHelp t
 he library serve you better while reaching more of the business community\
 ; provide suggestions on what small businesses really want from the librar
 y.\nExplore the use of the “Entrepreneurs Suite” at the North York Cen
 tral Library.\nCome early to network from 6-6:30pm!\nInformation Collectio
 n Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toron
 to Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\
 , and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program regis
 tration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles
  your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.c
 a\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
