 s of using smart phones\, tablets\, and laptops\nand learn about topics su
 ch as\ninstant messaging\, social media\, and file management\n. Get one o
 n one support in a welcoming and friendly environment.\nWe DO NOT help wit
 h printers or printing. Please bring your device with you to the program.\
 nIf you're a teen between the ages of 13-17 and would like to learn more a
 bout becoming a Seniors E-Connect volunteer\, visit the\nSeniors E-Connect
  Volunteering page\nor contact the branch.\nInformation Collection Notice:
