SUMMARY:Throwback Thursdays: Great Movies on the Big Screen
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261210T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261210T200000
UID:6aaec14df9ed2e003851f0af@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a radical retro rewind projected on the big s
 creen. Whether you're a first-time viewer or long-time fan\, these movies 
 are sure to please.\nSeptember 24: The Lincoln Lawyer (2011\, 14A)\nOctobe
 r 1: Knives Out (2019\, 14A)\nOctober 8: The Ice Storm (1997\, R)\nOctobe
 r 22: Aliens (1986\, 14+)\nOctober 29: Scream (1996\, 18A)\nAll are welco
 me. Drop-in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aaec14df9ed2e003851f0af
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
