X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Post Apocalyptic Book Club Toronto Chapter": "https://www.meetup.com/post-apocalyptic-book-club-toronto-chapter/events/316586931/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_post_apocalyptic_book_club_toronto_chapter
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Post-Apocalyptic Book Club
UID:event_316586931@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050445Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261214T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261214T203000
SUMMARY:Above the Fire by Michael O'Donnell
DESCRIPTION:Post-Apocalyptic Book Club - Toronto Chapter\nIt's our last PA
 BC meetup of 2026!\n\nThis time we'll be reading *Above the Fire* by Micha
 el O'Donnell. Here's the blurb:\n\nLaboring under a shared loss\, a father
  and son set out on a late-season backpacking trip through the mountains o
 f New Hampshire. They find beauty and solidarity in the outdoors\, making 
 friends along the way and falling into the rhythms of an expedition. But w
 hen war breaks out during their hike\, they are forced to withdraw even fu
 rther into the backcountry.\n\nSurviving an alpine winter by themselves\, 
 father and son must endure the elements\, the solitude\, and the ever-pres
 ent danger of outsiders. As their isolation intensifies\, their bond with 
 each other grows more fierce. From their mountain refuge they must confron
 t the perils of a changed world until they are forced to decide whether--a
 nd how--to rejoin society.\n\nThe book is available here:\n\nAmazon- Hardc
 over\, Paperback\, eBook\, Audiobook:\nhttps://a.co/d/0dxKoDg2\n\nIndigo- 
 Paperback:\nhttps://www.indigo.ca/products/above-the-fire?variant=46272670
 859474\n\nKobo- eBook:\nhttps://www.kobo.com/ca/en/ebook/above-the-fire-1?
 sId=3e2ef52f-58b4-456a-acb1-11c48e427c1e&ssId=4rhhSbtIooRtqUwTZiCOq&cPos=1
 \n\nToronto Public Library:\nhttps://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/record/S234C
 4443754\n\nLooking forward to seeing you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/post-apocalyptic-book-club-toronto-ch
 apter/events/316586931/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260916T214312Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260916T214312Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
