 ws "guests" to participate in most activities over the span of a 1-month p
 eriod. We are accepting Guest registrations. If you have not registered fo
 r the walk\, you may NOT join the walk. If you have registered but can't a
 ttend\, log in\, click on "Already registered"\, then cancel. Please check
  the website 2 hours before the start time\, in the unl...
