CREATED:20260603T185245Z
DESCRIPTION:This Friday\, from 7pm until late\, will be a "Bring Your Own"
  Games Night Social. And on the understanding that this event will only us
 e the upstairs level\, non-members (anyone who would join us for an open h
 ouse) are most welcome to join us.\n\n This is intended  to be a social 
 evening\, where food is ordered\, while the evening is spent playing board
  games\, card games\, or even some of the video games setup at Hacklab. ..
 . Where the "Bring Your Own" format is everyone arranging to either bring 
 or order what they want for food and drink -- possibly with a single group
  food order. And others are encouraged to bring any games they would like 
 to spend the evening playing.
