UID:69fa2603e13d3b4603b35d8f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages [6-12].\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club fo
 r participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously 
 supported\, in part\, by donors.
