SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Ping Pong
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261228T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261228T190000
UID:6ab02955a5dbde002aa60125@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Youth Hub every Monday to play ping pong with o
 ther teens! Ping pong table\, ping pong balls\, and paddles will be provid
 ed.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming
  place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are 
 always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a 
 branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Albion\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab02955a5dbde002aa60125
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
