SUMMARY:Health Support Table with SCHC
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261229T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261229T160000
UID:6a885360be1482002988fb06@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come have a conversation with the health team from the Scarbor
 ough Centre for Healthy Communities (SCHC)! Learn & get connected to a var
 iety of health care services.\nReceive support with navigating services li
 ke:\n- Cancer screening information and referrals\n- Diabetes education\n-
  Preventative care\n- Primary care information\n- Vaccination awareness\n-
  Mental health\n- Connections to community support services\nDrop-in! All 
 are welcome!\nThis event will take place every last Tuesday of each month 
 at Morningside library.
LOCATION:Morningside\, Program Room Foyer
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a885360be1482002988fb06
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
